#: ../../chapter03.rst:5
msgid "Tenant Administration"
msgstr "Lejeradministration"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:9
msgid ""
"A tenant is usually mapped to a company, or a division of a company, an "
"organization or in the case of MSP managed organization, a service "
"provider would call them clients. Basically, a tenant is a management "
"scope that represents an organization."
msgstr "En tenant er normalt tilknyttet et firma, eller en afdeling af et firma, en organisation eller i tilfældet med MSP-styrede organisationer, ville en tjenesteudbyder kalde dem klienter. Grundlæggende er en tenant en administrationsenhed, der repræsenterer en organisation."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:11
msgid ""
"Tenant manager scope is defined for tenant administrators. For a multi-"
"tenant Cluster Server system, each tenant has an administrator. For a "
"single-tenant Cluster Server system, the default cluster administrator is"
" also the tenant administrator."
msgstr "Omfanget af lejeradministratoren er defineret for lejeradministratorer. I et flerlejer Cluster Server-system har hver lejer en administrator. I et enkeltlejer Cluster Server-system er standard clusteradministratoren også lejeradministratoren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:13
msgid "Tenant Manager is completely web-based."
msgstr "Tenant Manager er fuldstændig webbaseret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:15
msgid ""
"From the Cluster Manager Dashboard, you can access the Tenant Manager by "
"clicking \"Tenants Count\"."
msgstr "Fra Cluster Manager Dashboard kan du få adgang til Tenant Manager ved at klikke på \"Antal lejere\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:20
msgid "CLUSTER DASHBOARD"
msgstr "KLUSTER DASHBOARD"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:22
msgid ""
"You can also log in directly to the web portal as the tenant "
"administrator instead of the default cluster administrator to get to the "
"tenant administrator management web interface."
msgstr "Du kan også logge direkte ind på webportalen som lejeradministrator i stedet for den standard klyngeadministrator for at komme til webgrænsefladen for lejeradministration."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:26
msgid ""
"At a high level, the Cluster Administrator and Tenant Manager have almost"
" identical controls for the Tenants within their scope; however, the "
"Tenant Manager settings will always take precedence and override Cluster "
"Administrator settings. Tenant Managers can give permission for Cluster "
"Administrator to manage their tenants by enabling this option in "
"``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > ``Security``. \"Allow "
"Cluster Admin to manage my tenant\" is by default checked."
msgstr "På et overordnet plan har Cluster Administrator og Tenant Manager næsten identiske kontrolmuligheder for de Tenants, der er inden for deres område; dog vil Tenant Manager-indstillingerne altid have forrang og tilsidesætte indstillingerne for Cluster Administrator. Tenant Managers kan give tilladelse til Cluster Administrator til at administrere deres tenants ved at aktivere denne mulighed i ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Sikkerhed``. \"Tillad Cluster Admin at administrere min tenant\" er som standard afkrydset."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:31
msgid "SETTINGS > USER ACCOUNT & SECURITY > SECURITY"
msgstr "INDSTILLINGER > BRUGERKONTO & SIKKERHED > SIKKERHED"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:36
msgid "Tenant Dashboard"
msgstr "Lejer Dashboard"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:38
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``[Tenant]`` > ``Tenant Dashboard``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``[Lejer]`` > ``Lejer Dashboard``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:43
msgid "TENANT DASHBOARD MENUS"
msgstr "LEJER DASHBOARD MENUER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:45
msgid ""
"You can navigate to different sections of Tenant Administration from the "
"Dashboard."
msgstr "Du kan navigere til forskellige sektioner af Tenant Administration fra Dashboardet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:49
msgid "Tenant Plan"
msgstr "Lejerplan"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:51
msgid "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``License/Storage Quota`` > ``Tenant Plan``"
msgstr "``Lejer Dashboard`` > ``Licens/Lagringskvote`` > ``Lejerplan``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:56 ../../chapter03.rst:64
msgid "TENANT PLAN SETTINGS"
msgstr "INDSTILLINGER FOR LEJERPLAN"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:58
msgid ""
"Here in the Tenant Plan section, you can change the tenant's user plan "
"and storage plan, and also control the bandwidth usage for the tenant."
msgstr "Her i sektionen for lejerplan kan du ændre lejerens brugerplan og lagerplan, samt også styre båndbreddeforbruget for lejeren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:68 ../../chapter03.rst:495 ../../chapter03.rst:537
msgid "Team Folders"
msgstr "Team Mapper"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:70
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Mapper``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:72
msgid ""
"The team folder concept is like a network share, meaning you can define a"
" folder and then add users and groups to the folder and thus turn it into"
" a team shared folder. The team folder will show up in the user's folder "
"list when the user is added to the team folder."
msgstr "Konceptet med teammappen er som et netværksdrev, hvilket betyder, at du kan definere en mappe og derefter tilføje brugere og grupper til mappen og dermed omdanne den til en delt teammappe. Teammappen vil dukke op i brugerens mappeoversigt, når brugeren tilføjes til teammappen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:77
msgid "ENTER TEAM FOLDER SECTION"
msgstr "GÅ IND I TEAM MAPPE AFDELINGEN"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:79
msgid ""
"When the server agent is in use, the team folder can be mapped directly "
"to a network share from the server where the server agent is installed."
msgstr "Når serveragenten er i brug, kan teammappen mappes direkte til et netværksdrev fra serveren, hvor serveragenten er installeret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:81
msgid ""
"When a directly connected network share is used, a team folder can be "
"mapped to an SMB/CIFS network share directly."
msgstr "Når et direkte tilsluttet netværksdrev anvendes, kan en teammappe mappes direkte til et SMB/CIFS netværksdrev."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:83
msgid "You can also turn any existing folder into a team folder."
msgstr "Du kan også omdanne enhver eksisterende mappe til en teammappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:85
msgid ""
"A Team folder has a tenant administrator scope so the team folder related"
" sharing is limited to the users inside the tenant."
msgstr "En Team-mappe har en lejeradministrator rækkevidde, så deling relateret til Team-mappen er begrænset til brugere inden for lejeren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:89
msgid ""
"By default, the files and folders that the administrator can see is "
"hidden away from the regular team user until those folders are published "
"to the team users."
msgstr "Som standard er de filer og mapper, som administratoren kan se, skjult for den almindelige teambruger, indtil disse mapper er offentliggjort for teambrugerne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:91
msgid ""
"Team Folders (Shared Work Space) are used for team-share collaborations. "
"Generally, Team Folders are converted from File Server Network shares. "
"Other Team Folder sources can be Google Storage, Amazon S3 (or S3 "
"Compatible), Amazon Cloud, Windows Azure Blob, WebDav, SharePoint, "
"Rackspace (US or UK) and OpenStack or you can create new folders under "
"the Tenant's root storage."
msgstr "Team-mapper (delt arbejdsområde) bruges til samarbejde om fildeling. Generelt konverteres Team-mapper fra filservernetværksdelinger. Andre kilder til Team-mapper kan være Google Storage, Amazon S3 (eller S3-kompatibel), Amazon Cloud, Windows Azure Blob, WebDav, SharePoint, Rackspace (US eller UK) og OpenStack, eller du kan oprette nye mapper under lejerens rodopbevaring."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:93
msgid ""
"In the \"Team Folders\" page, you can click \"Edit\" icon to manage team "
"shares, folder permissions and the underlying storage configuration."
msgstr "På siden \"Team Folders\" kan du klikke på ikonet \"Rediger\" for at administrere teamdelinger, mappe tilladelser og den underliggende lagringskonfiguration."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:99
msgid "MANAGING TEAM SHARES"
msgstr "STYRING AF TEAM SHARES"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:103
msgid "Create Team Folder"
msgstr "Opret Team Mappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:105
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` >  ``Team Folders`` > ``Add New Team Folder``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Mapper`` > ``Tilføj ny teammappe``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:107
msgid "You can click on the \"+\" sign to create a new team folder."
msgstr "Du kan klikke på \"+\" tegnet for at oprette en ny teammappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:112
msgid "ADDING A TEAM FOLDER"
msgstr "TILFØJELSE AF EN TEAMMAPPE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:114
msgid ""
"Once it is clicked, it shows four main sources of team folder, among "
"other options:"
msgstr "Når den er klikket på, viser den fire hovedkilder til teammappe blandt andre muligheder:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:116
msgid "Existing Tenant Storage (default location)"
msgstr "Eksisterende lejerlager (standardplacering)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:117
msgid "File Servers in Local Area Network"
msgstr "Filtjenere i lokalt netværk"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:118
msgid "Remote File Servers"
msgstr "Fjern Fileservere"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:119
msgid "Cloud Storage"
msgstr "Cloudlagring"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:124
msgid "TEAM FOLDER LOCATIONS"
msgstr "PLACERING AF TEAMMAPPER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:126
msgid "**Existing Tenant Storage (default location)**"
msgstr "**Eksisterende lejerlager (standardplacering)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:131
msgid "EXISTING TENANT STORAGE"
msgstr "EKISTERENDE LEJERLAGRING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Default Tenant Storage (1)**: The team folder will be created from the "
"default storage from scratch with an empty team folder. Usually when you "
"want to have a team folder that is brand new and empty, you can pick this"
" option."
msgstr "**Standardlager for lejer (1)**: Teammappen oprettes fra standardlageret fra bunden med en tom teammappe. Normalt når du ønsker at have en helt ny og tom teammappe, kan du vælge denne mulighed."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:135
msgid ""
"**Existing Folder(s) (2)**: You can pick several existing folders, which "
"physically may not be in the same folder, but you can logically arrange "
"them into the same team folder. For example, you may want to have a short"
" term project that put \"Building A\", \"Blue Print A\", \"Budget A\", "
"three different folders from three different places into one logical"
msgstr "**Eksisterende mappe(r) (2)**: Du kan vælge flere eksisterende mapper, som fysisk set måske ikke er i den samme mappe, men du kan logisk arrangere dem i den samme teammappe. For eksempel kan du have et kortvarigt projekt, der sætter \"Bygning A\", \"Blåtryk A\", \"Budget A\", tre forskellige mapper fra tre forskellige steder sammen i en logisk"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:137
msgid ""
"**Publish Tenant Home Storage As a Team Folder (3)**: By default, the "
"tenant's root storage folder is not published to any team user. To use an"
" analogy, it is like a C: drive on a Windows File Server, by default it "
"is not published as a network share to users. However, if you want to "
"make it available to users, you can pick this option."
msgstr "**Udgiv Tenant Home Storage som en Team Mappe (3)**: Som standard er tenantens rodmappe for lagring ikke udgivet til nogen teambruger. For at bruge en analogi er det som et C: drev på en Windows-filserver, som standard er det ikke udgivet som et netværksdrev til brugere. Men hvis du ønsker at gøre det tilgængeligt for brugere, kan du vælge denne mulighed."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:141
msgid "**File Servers in Local Area Network**"
msgstr "**Filtjenere i lokalt netværk**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:143
msgid ""
"When you have files and folders from the local area network (LAN), you "
"can convert the network share directly into a team folder in the Cluster "
"Server. It is a one-to-one relationship between a team folder and a "
"network share. When you pick this option, most of the time, the Active "
"Directory server for this tenant is also in the same Local Area Network."
msgstr "Når du har filer og mapper fra det lokale område netværk (LAN), kan du konvertere netværksdelen direkte til en teammappe i Cluster Serveren. Der er et en-til-en forhold mellem en teammappe og en netværksdel. Når du vælger denne mulighed, er det meste af tiden også sådan, at Active Directory serveren for denne lejer er i det samme lokale område netværk."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:148
msgid "LAN-BASED TEAM FOLDER"
msgstr "LAN-BASERET TEAM MAPPE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:150
msgid "**Remote File Server**"
msgstr "**Fjern Filserver**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:152
msgid ""
"When you have server agents installed on remote file servers, those file "
"servers will be visible and the network shares from remote file servers "
"will be imported to the Cluster Server."
msgstr "Når du har serveragenter installeret på fjernfiler servere, vil disse filservere være synlige, og netværksdelinger fra fjernfilservere vil blive importeret til klynge serveren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:157
msgid "REMOTE TEAM FOLDER"
msgstr "FJERNHOLDSTEAMMAPPE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:159
msgid "**Cloud Storage**"
msgstr "**Cloudlagring**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:161
msgid ""
"You can also pick Cloud Storage as this team folder's underlying storage."
" As shown in the following picture, you can pick Amazon S3, Windows Azure"
" Blob, OpenStack Swift, and other cloud storage services."
msgstr "Du kan også vælge Cloud Storage som den underliggende lagring for denne teammappe. Som vist på billedet nedenfor, kan du vælge Amazon S3, Windows Azure Blob, OpenStack Swift og andre cloud lagringstjenester."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:166
msgid "CLOUD-BASED TEAM FOLDER"
msgstr "SKYBASERET TEAMMAPPE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:169
msgid "Team Folder Properties"
msgstr "Egenskaber for Team Mappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:172
msgid "Team Folder Information"
msgstr "Information om Team Mappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:174
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` >  ``Team Folders`` >  ``{Pick a Team Folder}`` > "
"``Info Icon`` > ``Team Folder Information``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Pick a Team Folder}`` > ``Info-ikon`` > ``Information om Team Folder``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:179
msgid "TEAM FOLDER INFORMATION ACCESS"
msgstr "TEAM MAPPE INFORMATION ADGANG"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:183
msgid "Collaborators"
msgstr "Samarbejdspartnere"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:185
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Pick a Team Folder}`` > ``Edit"
" Icon`` > ``Collaborators``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Vælg en Team Folder}`` > ``Rediger ikon`` > ``Samarbejdspartnere``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:187
msgid "In the Collaborators section, you can define:"
msgstr "I afsnittet Samarbejdspartnere kan du definere:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:189
msgid ""
"User List: The users and groups that are assigned to the team folder. The"
" users with the owner flag will be able to manage the users."
msgstr "Brugerliste: Brugerne og grupperne, der er tildelt teammappen. Brugere med ejerflaget vil kunne administrere brugerne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:197
msgid "EDITING FOLDER PERMISSIONS"
msgstr "REDIGERING AF MAPPE TILLADELSER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:201
msgid "External Sharing"
msgstr "Ekstern deling"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:203
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Pick a Team Folder}`` > ``Edit"
" Icon`` > ``External Sharing``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Mapper`` > ``{Vælg en Team Mappe}`` > ``Rediger Ikon`` > ``Ekstern Deling``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:205
msgid ""
"You can see what folders and files have been shared and control access to"
" those files from this setting."
msgstr "Du kan se, hvilke mapper og filer der er blevet delt, og kontrollere adgangen til disse filer fra denne indstilling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:210 ../../chapter03.rst:288
msgid "TEAM FOLDER PERMISSION SETTINGS"
msgstr "TEAM MAPPE TILLADELSER INDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:214
msgid "Access Policy"
msgstr "Adgangspolitik"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:216
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Pick a Team Folder}`` > ``Edit"
" Icon`` > ``Access Policy``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Mapper`` > ``{Vælg en Team Mappe}`` > ``Rediger Ikon`` > ``Adgangspolitik``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:218
msgid "You can enable an access policy through this tab."
msgstr "Du kan aktivere en adgangspolitik via denne fane."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:223
msgid "ADD NEW ACCESS POLICY"
msgstr "TILFØJ NY ADGANGSPOLITIK"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:225
msgid ""
"Define customized access policies to restrict and allow access based on "
"the device location. For example, a company can enable access from the "
"internet to only Windows clients and web clients. IT can configure allow "
"or deny client access policies from the following locations:"
msgstr "Definer tilpassede adgangspolitikker for at begrænse og tillade adgang baseret på enhedens placering. For eksempel kan et firma tillade adgang fra internettet kun til Windows-klienter og webklienter. IT kan konfigurere tillade- eller nægte-klientadgangspolitikker fra følgende steder:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:227 ../../chapter03.rst:245
msgid "Access from the internet"
msgstr "Adgang fra internettet"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:228 ../../chapter03.rst:246
msgid "Access from local network"
msgstr "Adgang fra lokalt netværk"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:229 ../../chapter03.rst:247
msgid "Access from Anywhere"
msgstr "Adgang fra hvor som helst"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:230 ../../chapter03.rst:248
msgid "Access from customer-defined networks"
msgstr "Adgang fra kundedefinerede netværk"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:231 ../../chapter03.rst:249
msgid "Deny access from customer defined networks"
msgstr "Nægt adgang fra netværk defineret af kunden"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:233
msgid ""
"The above allow and deny client access policies can be configured for the"
" following clients:"
msgstr "Ovenstående tillad og nægt klientadgangspolitikker kan konfigureres for følgende klienter:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:235
msgid "Web client"
msgstr "Webklient"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:236
msgid "Web management"
msgstr "Webstyring"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:237
msgid "Windows client"
msgstr "Windows-klient"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:238
msgid "Mac client"
msgstr "Mac-klient"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:239
msgid "Mobile client"
msgstr "Mobilklient"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:243
msgid ""
"IT can also prevent data loss and data leakage of important company "
"confidential shares by configuring 'Share Access Policies' for external "
"users who are not company employees. Again, IT can configure allow or "
"deny shares access policies from the following locations:"
msgstr "IT kan også forhindre datatab og lækage af vigtige firmafortrolige shares ved at konfigurere 'Share Access Policies' for eksterne brugere, der ikke er firmaansatte. Endnu en gang kan IT konfigurere tillad eller nægt shares adgangspolitikker fra følgende steder:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:251
msgid ""
"The above allow and deny share access policies can be configured with the"
" following conditions:"
msgstr "De ovenstående tillad og nægt delingsadgangspolitikker kan konfigureres med følgende betingelser:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:253
msgid "Visible"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter03.rst:254
msgid "Permissions to list files"
msgstr "Tilladelser til at liste filer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:255
msgid "Permissions to read files"
msgstr "Tilladelser til at læse filer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:256
msgid "Permissions to create or update files and folders"
msgstr "Tilladelser til at oprette eller opdatere filer og mapper"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:257
msgid "Permissions to delete files and folders"
msgstr "Tilladelser til at slette filer og mapper"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:258
msgid "Secure data room"
msgstr "Sikker datarum"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:263
msgid "SHARE ACCESS POLICY"
msgstr "DELEADGANGSPOLITIK"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:268
msgid "ACCESS POLICY SETTINGS"
msgstr "ADGANGSPOLITIKINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:271 ../../chapter03.rst:499 ../../chapter03.rst:579
msgid "Folder Permissions"
msgstr "Mappe Tilladelser"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:273
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Pick a Team Folder}`` > ``Edit"
" Icon`` > ``Folder Permissions``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Vælg en Team Folder}`` > ``Rediger ikon`` > ``Mappe Tilladelser``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:275
msgid ""
"You can browse to different sub-folders and define the folder permission."
" The folder permissions defined here represent the Cluster Server side of"
" the permission."
msgstr "Du kan navigere til forskellige undermapper og definere mappe tilladelserne. De mappe tilladelser, der er defineret her, repræsenterer server-siden af tilladelserne i klyngen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:277
msgid ""
"If you are leveraging native Active Directory/NTFS permission from a file"
" server, you don't need to define any permissions here."
msgstr "Hvis du bruger native Active Directory/NTFS-tilladelser fra en filserver, behøver du ikke at definere nogen tilladelser her."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:281
msgid ""
"You can think of the permissions as two different gates controlling the "
"access to files and folders. The first gate is defined here as the "
"``Cluster Server Folder Permission``. After this permission check, there "
"is still a check at the file server level (which is the NTFS permission)."
msgstr "Du kan tænke på tilladelserne som to forskellige porte, der kontrollerer adgangen til filer og mapper. Den første port er defineret her som ``Cluster Server Folder Permission``. Efter denne tilladelseskontrol er der stadig en kontrol på filserverniveauet (som er NTFS-tilladelsen)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:283
msgid ""
"In practice, usually it is done one way or the other. If you have decided"
" to use NTFS natively, you can leave the permission settings here empty "
"and not defined."
msgstr "I praksis gøres det normalt på den ene eller den anden måde. Hvis du har besluttet at bruge NTFS i sin native form, kan du lade tilladelsesindstillingerne her være tomme og ikke definerede."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:292 ../../chapter03.rst:304 ../../chapter03.rst:607
#: ../../chapter03.rst:931
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:294
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Pick a Team Folder}`` > ``Edit"
" Icon`` > ``Settings``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Team Folders`` > ``{Vælg en Team Folder}`` > ``Rediger ikon`` > ``Indstillinger``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:299
msgid "TEAM FOLDER SETTINGS OVERVIEW"
msgstr "OVERSIGT OVER INDSTILLINGER FOR TEAMMAPPE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:301
msgid "Let's look at the details of the Team Folder Settings:"
msgstr "Lad os se nærmere på detaljerne i Team Mappe Indstillingerne:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:306
msgid "**Disable further sharing**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver yderligere deling**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:308
msgid "Don't allow users to share out team folder contents."
msgstr "Tillad ikke brugere at dele indhold fra teammapper."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:310
msgid "**Create CIFS Share**"
msgstr "**Opret CIFS-deling**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:312
msgid ""
"If there are server agents connected to the tenant, create a CIFS share "
"on the file server agent server as a standard Windows network share."
msgstr "Hvis der er serveragenter forbundet til lejeren, opret en CIFS-deling på filserveragentserveren som et standard Windows-netværkshare."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:314
msgid "**Disable Offline Access**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver offlineadgang**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:316
msgid ""
"Don't allow Windows clients or Mac clients to mark their folders as "
"offline from within the team folder."
msgstr "Tillad ikke Windows-klienter eller Mac-klienter at markere deres mapper som offline inden i teammappen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:320
msgid "Permission"
msgstr "Tilladelse"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:322
msgid "**Hide folders to which users don't have permissions**"
msgstr "**Skjul mapper, som brugerne ikke har tilladelse til**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:324
msgid ""
"Hide the folder instead of showing users folders that they will receive "
"\"Access Denied\"."
msgstr "Skjul mappen i stedet for at vise brugerne mapper, som de vil modtage \"Adgang nægtet\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:328
msgid "Quota and Retention Policy"
msgstr "Kvote og Bevaringspolitik"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:330
msgid "Team folder can have a per-team folder retention policy."
msgstr "Teammappe kan have en bevarelsespolitik for hver teammappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:335
msgid "Device Manager"
msgstr "Enhedsadministrator"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:337
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Devices`` > ``Device Manager``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Enheder`` > ``Enhedsadministrator``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:339
msgid ""
"The cluster administrator can look at the devices that have the client "
"agent software installed and connected in the specific tenant."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan se på de enheder, der har klientagentsoftwaren installeret og forbundet i den specifikke lejer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:341
msgid ""
"This feature is used to control BYOD (Bring your own device). For some "
"organization, they want to control who can bring what device into the "
"system. This is the tool to control that and allow/disallow on a device "
"by device basis."
msgstr "Denne funktion bruges til at styre BYOD (Bring din egen enhed). For nogle organisationer ønsker de at kontrollere, hvem der kan medbringe hvilken enhed i systemet. Dette er værktøjet til at styre det og tillade/forbyde på en enhed-til-enhed basis."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:346
msgid "DEVICE MANAGER SETTINGS"
msgstr "ENHEDSSTYRINGSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:350
msgid "User Management"
msgstr "Brugeradministration"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:353
msgid "Regular User"
msgstr "Almindelig bruger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:354
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Users`` > ``User Manager``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Brugere`` > ``Brugeradministration``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:360
msgid "TENANT ADMIN > USER MANAGER"
msgstr "TENANT ADMIN > BRUGERSTYRING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:362
msgid ""
"To access the user manager, you can click the number of users on "
"Dashboard, or click the \"Users\" on left side menu."
msgstr "For at få adgang til brugeradministratoren kan du klikke på antallet af brugere på Dashboard, eller klikke på \"Brugere\" i venstre side menu."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:364
msgid ""
"In the Documentation, the regular user is often referenced as \"Team "
"User\"."
msgstr "I dokumentationen henvises der ofte til den almindelige bruger som \"Teambruger\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:366
msgid ""
"These are the users that have full privilege of home directory, sharing "
"and other features."
msgstr "Dette er brugerne, der har fuld privilegium af hjemmemappe, deling og andre funktioner."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:368
msgid "User Manager also have a list view:"
msgstr "Brugerstyring har også en listevisning:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:374
msgid "USER MANAGER LIST/ICON VIEW TOGGLE"
msgstr "BRUGERSTYRING LISTE/IKON VISNING SKIFT"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:376
msgid ""
"If you have Active Directory, normally these are the users in the Active "
"Directory."
msgstr "Hvis du har Active Directory, er det normalt disse brugere i Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:378
msgid "Native User"
msgstr "Indfødt bruger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:380
msgid "These are the users that are created manually with an email."
msgstr "Dette er brugere, der er oprettet manuelt med en e-mail."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:382
msgid "AD User"
msgstr "AD-bruger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:384
msgid "These are the users that are imported from Active Directory via LDAP."
msgstr "Dette er brugerne, der er importeret fra Active Directory via LDAP."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:386
msgid "Proxied AD User"
msgstr "Proxied AD-bruger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:388
msgid ""
"These are the users that are imported from Server Agent, where the file "
"server agent is remote and away from the Cluster Server in the customer's"
" site. The customer's Active Directory domain is also remote, and the "
"file server itself (where server agent is installed) is in the remote "
"Active Directory."
msgstr "Disse er brugerne, der er importeret fra Server Agent, hvor filserveragenten er fjern og væk fra Cluster Server på kundens sted. Kundens Active Directory-domæne er også fjern, og selve filserveren (hvor serveragenten er installeret) er i det fjerne Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:391
msgid "**User's File and Folder List**"
msgstr "**Brugerens fil- og mappeoversigt**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:396
msgid "VIEWING A USER'S FILE AND FOLDER LIST"
msgstr "VISNING AF EN BRUGERS FIL- OG MAPPELISTE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:398
msgid ""
"An admin can view a user's file and folder list using the drive icon "
"**(3)** for the user in Management Console\\User Manager."
msgstr "En administrator kan se en brugers fil- og mappe liste ved at bruge drevikonet **(3)** for brugeren i Management Console\User Manager."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:400
msgid ""
"First switch the icon view **(1)** to detail view **(2)** and click the "
"drive icon **(3)** next to the user you are examining. This will open a "
"new window **(4)** where you can view the files."
msgstr "Først skift ikonvisningen **(1)** til detaljevisning **(2)** og klik på drevikonet **(3)** ved siden af den bruger, du undersøger. Dette vil åbne et nyt vindue **(4)**, hvor du kan se filerne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:404 ../../chapter03.rst:1021
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Gæstebruger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:405
msgid "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``Guest Users`` > ``Guest User Manager``"
msgstr "``Lejer Dashboard`` > ``Gæstebrugere`` > ``Gæstebruger Manager``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:410
msgid "TENANT ADMIN > GUEST USER MANAGER"
msgstr "TENANT ADMIN > GÆSTE BRUGERSTYRING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:412
msgid ""
"Guest users are users that don't have a home directory. The only folder "
"they have is “Files Shared with Me”. So they rely on other “Regular User”"
" sharing files and folders with them before they can do anything. If "
"nobody is sharing anything with a guest user, the guest user doesn't have"
" any read/write permission to any folder."
msgstr "Gæstebrugere er brugere, der ikke har en hjemmemappe. Den eneste mappe, de har, er \"Filer delt med mig\". Så de er afhængige af, at andre \"Almindelige brugere\" deler filer og mapper med dem, før de kan foretage sig noget. Hvis ingen deler noget med en gæstebruger, har gæstebrugeren ingen læse-/skriverettigheder til nogen mapper."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:414
msgid ""
"The primary reason for guest user to exist is to have a secure way for "
"external user to collaborate and edit documents."
msgstr "Den primære årsag til, at gæstebrugeren eksisterer, er at have en sikker måde for eksterne brugere at samarbejde og redigere dokumenter på."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:418
msgid "Group Manager"
msgstr "Gruppechef"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:419
msgid "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``Groups`` > ``Group Manager``"
msgstr "``Lejer Dashboard`` > ``Grupper`` > ``Gruppeadministrator``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:424
msgid "TENANT ADMIN > GROUP MANAGER"
msgstr "TENANT ADMIN > GRUPPEADMINISTRATOR"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:426
msgid ""
"When you have Active Directory integration, you will leverage the Active "
"Directory group instead of using Group Manager here. This group manager "
"is to create a group of users in a simple way. It is not as complicated "
"as Active Directory (such as supporting nested groups) but make it easy "
"for non-Active Directory users. This is native Cluster group. In the "
"product, you may also see AD group from the user selection user interface"
" and Proxied AD group from the user related interface. The AD group and "
"the proxied AD group are not the same as the group mentioned here."
msgstr "Når du har integration med Active Directory, vil du benytte Active Directory-gruppen i stedet for at bruge Gruppeadministrator her. Denne gruppeadministrator er til at oprette en gruppe af brugere på en enkel måde. Det er ikke så kompliceret som Active Directory (såsom at understøtte indlejrede grupper), men gør det let for ikke-Active Directory-brugere. Dette er en indfødt Cluster-gruppe. I produktet kan du også se AD-gruppe fra brugerudvælgelsesgrænsefladen og Proxied AD-gruppe fra brugerrelateret grænseflade. AD-gruppen og den proxiede AD-gruppe er ikke det samme som gruppen nævnt her."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:430
msgid "Role Manager"
msgstr "Rollehåndtering"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:432
msgid "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``Roles`` > ``Role Manager``"
msgstr "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``Roller`` > ``Rolleadministrator``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:434
msgid ""
"The Role Manager is to provide role based administration. For example, "
"you may want to provide read-only permissions to some users. You can also"
" assign some group policies to some groups of users. More and more policy"
" items are added to the role manager so in addition to only use role "
"manager for administration, it can be also used to define policy items "
"for users."
msgstr "Rollehåndteringen er til at levere administrationsbaseret på roller. For eksempel, du ønsker måske at give skrivebeskyttede tilladelser til nogle brugere. Du kan også tildele nogle gruppepolitikker til nogle grupper af brugere. Flere og flere politikelementer tilføjes til rollehåndteringen, så ud over kun at bruge rollehåndteringen til administration, kan den også bruges til at definere politikelementer for brugere."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:439
msgid "ROLE MANAGER ENTRY"
msgstr "ROLLESTYRINGSINDGANG"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:441
msgid "When creating a role, there are 4 different sections"
msgstr "Når du opretter en rolle, er der 4 forskellige sektioner"

