#: ../../chapter03.rst:557
msgid ""
"Audit trace contains the management events, such as login success, login "
"fail , shared a folder and etc."
msgstr "Revisionsloggen indeholder administrationshændelser, såsom login succes, login fejl, delte en mappe og lignende."

