#: ../../chapter03.rst:566
msgid "File Change Log"
msgstr "Filændringslog"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:568
msgid ""
"File change log is capable of search for user's file change history. It "
"is most useful when helping user troubleshoot issues. For example, you "
"can point to the file change log and say, you deleted this file on this "
"day."
msgstr "Filændringsloggen er i stand til at søge efter brugerens filændringshistorik. Det er mest nyttigt, når man hjælper brugeren med at fejlfinde problemer. For eksempel kan du pege på filændringsloggen og sige, at du slettede denne fil på denne dag."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:575
msgid "FILE CHANGE LOGGING REPORT"
msgstr "FILÆNDRINGSLOGGNINGSRAPPORT"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:584
msgid "FOLDER PERMISSIONS REPORT"
msgstr "MAPPERETNING OM MAPPEBERETTIGELSER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:593
msgid "DISTRIBUTED LOCKS REPORT"
msgstr "DISTRIBUTEREDE LÅSERAPPORT"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:597
msgid "Pending Purged Folder"
msgstr "Afventer Tømt Mappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:602
msgid "PENDING PURGED FOLDER REPORT"
msgstr "VENTER PÅ SLETTET MAPPE RAPPORT"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:611
msgid "Active Directory"
msgstr "Active Directory"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:612
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Active Directory``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Active Directory``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:617
msgid "ACTIVE DIRECTORY SETTINGS"
msgstr "ACTIVE DIRECTORY INDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:620
msgid "Local Active Directory"
msgstr "Lokal Active Directory"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:621
msgid ""
"If the tenant's infrastructure is in the same local area network as the "
"Cluster Server, the Active Directory can be directly accessed and "
"integrated from the \"Local Active Directory\" page. The integration is "
"done over LDAP protocol."
msgstr "Hvis lejerens infrastruktur er i samme lokale netværk som klynge-serveren, kan Active Directory direkte tilgås og integreres fra \"Lokal Active Directory\"-siden. Integrationen sker over LDAP-protokollen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:623
msgid ""
"However, if the tenant's infrastructure is away from the Cluster Server, "
"it is recommended using \"Server Agent\" to connect both the tenant's "
"file server and Active Directory to the Cluster Server."
msgstr "Hvis lejerens infrastruktur er væk fra klyngeserveren, anbefales det at bruge \"Server Agent\" til at forbinde både lejerens filserver og Active Directory med klyngeserveren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:627
msgid ""
"If your Active Directory is away from the Cluster Server over the "
"Internet, skip the \"Local Active Directory\" section but use the "
"\"Remote Active Directory\" instead."
msgstr "Hvis dit Active Directory er væk fra Cluster Serveren over internettet, skal du springe afsnittet \"Lokalt Active Directory\" over, men i stedet bruge \"Fjern Active Directory\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:629
msgid "Use LDAP AD Setting only if the AD is in the same Local Area Network."
msgstr "Brug kun LDAP AD-indstilling, hvis AD er i det samme lokale netværk."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:633
msgid ""
"The difference between using LDAP to connect Active Directory and using "
"\"Server Agent\" to connect Active Directory:"
msgstr "Forskellen mellem at bruge LDAP til at forbinde Active Directory og at bruge \"Server Agent\" til at forbinde Active Directory:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:635
msgid ""
"By using LDAP to connect Active Directory, the assumption is that the "
"LDAP is local in the local area network so the speed is very fast and "
"also very reliable. So a lot of the calls and queries are directly "
"passing through to Active Directory."
msgstr "Ved at bruge LDAP til at forbinde Active Directory er antagelsen, at LDAP er lokal i det lokale netværk, så hastigheden er meget hurtig og også meget pålidelig. Så mange af opkaldene og forespørgslerne går direkte igennem til Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:637
msgid ""
"By Using Server Agent to connect Active Directory, the assumption is that"
" the Active Directory is in a remote location and over the Internet so "
"the access speed may not be fast and the Internet may not be 100 percent "
"up and reliable. So the server agent replicates Active Directory related "
"information over to the Cluster Server."
msgstr "Ved at bruge Server Agent til at forbinde Active Directory, er antagelsen, at Active Directory befinder sig på en fjern lokation og over internettet, så adgangshastigheden er muligvis ikke hurtig, og internettet er muligvis ikke 100 procent oppe og pålideligt. Så serveragenten replikerer Active Directory-relateret information over til Cluster Serveren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:641
msgid ""
"The connection to local active directory is via LDAP over Local Area "
"Network. If the active directory infrastructure is in the same network as"
" the Cluster Server, this is a convenient way to connect to the active "
"directory."
msgstr "Forbindelsen til det lokale aktive katalog er via LDAP over lokalt netværk. Hvis den aktive kataloginfrastruktur er i samme netværk som klynge-serveren, er dette en bekvem måde at forbinde til det aktive katalog på."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:644
msgid "AD Server"
msgstr "AD-server"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:649
msgid "ACTIVE DIRECTORY - AD SERVER"
msgstr "ACTIVE DIRECTORY - AD SERVER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:651
msgid "**Enable Active Directory Integration**"
msgstr "**Aktivér Active Directory-integration**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:653
msgid "You will check this when you want to integration with Active Directory."
msgstr "Du vil tjekke dette, når du ønsker at integrere med Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:658
msgid ""
"There are two different ways to integrate with Active Directory. One way "
"is here, using the Lightweight Directory Access Protocol (LDAP) "
"connection. The other way is to leverage the server agent software. The "
"server agent software is capable of connecting a remote Active Directory."
msgstr "Der er to forskellige måder at integrere med Active Directory på. En måde er her, ved at bruge Lightweight Directory Access Protocol (LDAP) forbindelsen. Den anden måde er at udnytte server agent softwaren. Server agent softwaren er i stand til at forbinde en fjern Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:660
msgid "**Domain Controller Address**"
msgstr "**Domænecontrolleradresse**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:662
msgid "The domain controller's address, typically in the form of DNS name."
msgstr "Domænecontrollerens adresse, typisk i form af DNS-navn."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:664 ../../chapter03.rst:1919
msgid "**User Name**"
msgstr "**Brugernavn**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:666
msgid ""
"This is recommended to be a service account (password never expire, "
"account never disable” so the user will be able to query LDAP for users "
"and authenticate users on the login user's behave."
msgstr "Det anbefales at være en servicekonto (adgangskode udløber aldrig, konto deaktiveres aldrig), så brugeren vil kunne forespørge LDAP efter brugere og autentificere brugere på den loggende brugers vegne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:668 ../../chapter03.rst:1924
msgid "**Password**"
msgstr "**Adgangskode**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:670
msgid "This is the password for the service account for the “User Name” field."
msgstr "Dette er adgangskoden til tjenestekontoen for feltet “Brugernavn”."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:674
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Avancerede indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:679
msgid "ACTIVE DIRECTORY - ADVANCED SETTINGS"
msgstr "ACTIVE DIRECTORY - AVANCEREDE INDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:682
msgid "**Friendly Domain Name**"
msgstr "**Venligt Domænenavn**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:684
msgid ""
"**(i.e. mydomain.com, the domain name you see in Active Directory "
"tools)** This is typically the domain name you see in the Microsoft "
"Domain and User tool. It needs to be exact match of the domain name. "
"Otherwise, you will see error message about “referral is required” , "
"which translates to the domain controller didn't match the domain name "
"and need to refer you to somewhere else for another domain name."
msgstr "**(dvs. mydomain.com, domænenavnet du ser i Active Directory-værktøjer)** Dette er typisk det domænenavn, du ser i Microsofts værktøj til domæne og brugere. Det skal være en nøjagtig match af domænenavnet. Ellers vil du se en fejlmeddelelse om 'henvisning er nødvendig', hvilket betyder, at domænecontrolleren ikke matchede domænenavnet og har brug for at henvise dig til et andet sted for et andet domænenavn."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:689
msgid "FRIENDLY DOMAIN NAME EXAMPLE"
msgstr "VENLIGT DOMÆNENAVN EKSEMPEL"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:691
msgid "**Enable LDAPS for secure access**"
msgstr "**Aktivér LDAPS for sikker adgang**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:693
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. Enable this if you are using SSL security on the "
"domain."
msgstr "Deaktiveret som standard. Aktivér dette, hvis du bruger SSL-sikkerhed på domænet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:695
msgid "**Only include users and groups from the following Organizational Units**"
msgstr "**Inkluder kun brugere og grupper fra følgende organisationsenheder**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:697
msgid ""
"**(e.g. OU=ou1,OU=ou2. Leave this blank to include all OUs)** When you "
"type in the organization unit, you don't need to type the domain part any"
" more. It just need the Organization Unit part of the string. This is "
"allowed for only single Organization Unit specified in its "
"distinguishedName format without the domain suffix."
msgstr "**(f.eks. OU=ou1,OU=ou2. Lad dette felt være tomt for at inkludere alle OUs)** Når du indtaster organisationenheden, behøver du ikke at skrive domænedelen mere. Det kræver kun Organisationenhedens del af strengen. Dette er tilladt for kun én enkelt Organisationenhed specificeret i sit distinguishedName-format uden domænesuffikset."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:699
msgid "**Allow Switching to Global Catalog If needed**"
msgstr "**Tillad skift til Global Katalog hvis nødvendigt**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:701
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. For some organization that has multiple domain, "
"sometimes there is a Global Catalog that stores everything inside. This "
"may be required if you have such situation."
msgstr "Som standard deaktiveret. For nogle organisationer, der har flere domæner, er der undertiden en Global Katalog, der gemmer alt indeni. Dette kan være nødvendigt, hvis du har en sådan situation."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:703
msgid "**Disable Nested Groups**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver indlejrede grupper**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:705
msgid ""
"Not checked by default. **(Activating this checkbox may slow down your "
"access to cloud)** Normally you will activate this option if you have "
"many groups."
msgstr "Ikke markeret som standard. **(Aktivering af denne afkrydsningsfelt kan sænke din adgang til skyen)** Normalt vil du aktivere denne mulighed, hvis du har mange grupper."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:707
msgid "**This is the root of the AD Forest and contains multiple sub-domains**"
msgstr "**Dette er roden af AD-skoven og indeholder flere underdomæner**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:709
msgid ""
"The Cluster Server supports multiple domains in the same AD forest. You "
"will need to point to the root of the AD and it is capable of finding all"
" the sub-domains if you enable the **Discover domain controller IP at "
"runtime** sub-opion."
msgstr "Klynge-serveren understøtter flere domæner i den samme AD-skov. Du skal pege på roden af AD, og den er i stand til at finde alle underdomænerne, hvis du aktiverer **Opdag domænecontrollerens IP ved kørsel** underindstillingen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:711
msgid "**Don't allow user auto-creation**"
msgstr "**Tillad ikke automatisk oprettelse af brugere**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:713
msgid ""
"By default, the Enterprise package is capable of creating users upon "
"first login into the web portal. However, for big enterprise, they may "
"want to control the pace of adding users to the system so they will "
"disable this feature."
msgstr "Som standard er Enterprise-pakken i stand til at oprette brugere ved første login i webportalen. Dog kan større virksomheder ønske at kontrollere tempoet for tilføjelse af brugere til systemet, så de vil deaktivere denne funktion."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:715 ../../chapter03.rst:1291
msgid "**Publish user's home drive**"
msgstr "**Udgiv brugerens hjemmedrev**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:717
msgid ""
"When unchecked (default), the user home drive space will be allocated "
"from enterprise storage. When checked, existing user home drives will be "
"automatically published from Active Directory."
msgstr "Når den er frakoblet (standard), vil brugerens hjemdrevs plads blive tildelt fra virksomhedens lager. Når den er markeret, vil eksisterende brugeres hjemdrev automatisk blive offentliggjort fra Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:722
msgid "USER'S PROFILE HOME FOLDER SETTING"
msgstr "BRUGERENS PROFIL HJEMMEMAPPEINDSTILLING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:729
msgid "Single Sign-On (SAML Integration)"
msgstr "Single Sign-On (SAML-integration)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:731
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Single Sign-On``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Single Sign-On``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:733
msgid "Single Sign on via SAML is a per-tenant setting."
msgstr "Single Sign on via SAML er en pr. lejer-indstilling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:738
msgid "ACCESSING SINGLE SIGN ON (SSO) SETTINGS"
msgstr "ADGANG TIL INDSTILLINGER FOR ENKELTLOGON (SSO)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:744
msgid "SINGLE SIGN ON (SSO) SETTINGS"
msgstr "INDSTILLINGER FOR ENKELT LOGON (SSO)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:747
msgid "Single Sign-On is available using SAML authentication."
msgstr "Single Sign-On er tilgængelig ved brug af SAML-godkendelse."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:749
msgid ""
"When it comes to Single Sign-On support via SAML, there are always two "
"parties."
msgstr "Når det kommer til Single Sign-On support via SAML, er der altid to parter."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:751
msgid "One is the IdP (the identity provider)"
msgstr "En er IdP (identitetsudbyderen)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:752
msgid "and the other is SP (service provider)"
msgstr "og den anden er SP (serviceudbyder)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:754
msgid ""
"A user will be registered with the identity provider and use the service "
"from service provider. The setup here is to allow service provider (the "
"Cluster Server) to use an identity provider."
msgstr "En bruger vil blive registreret hos identitetsudbyderen og bruge tjenesten fra tjenesteudbyderen. Opsætningen her er for at tillade tjenesteudbyderen (Cluster Serveren) at bruge en identitetsudbyder."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:757
msgid ""
"The SAML single sign on setup is mostly about matching parameters from "
"the identity provider to the identity consumer (service provider). As "
"shown in the screen capture, There are three types of identity provider, "
"\"Azure AD\" , \"AD FS\" , and \"others (generic)\" that pretty much "
"covers the most used ones and the most generic ones."
msgstr "Opsætningen af SAML single sign on handler for det meste om at matche parametre fra identitetsudbyderen til identitetsforbrugeren (tjenesteudbyderen). Som vist i skærmbilledet, er der tre typer af identitetsudbydere, \"Azure AD\", \"AD FS\" og \"andre (generisk)\" som dækker de mest brugte og de mest generiske."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:762
msgid "**Others (Generic SAML)**"
msgstr "**Andre (Generisk SAML)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:764
msgid ""
"Here, The IdP will be a public IdP such as SSOCircle and the SP will be "
"the Cluster Server. The SSOCircle is used as an example to set up the "
"IdP; it can work with other IdP as well."
msgstr "Her vil IdP være en offentlig IdP som SSOCircle, og SP vil være Cluster Serveren. SSOCircle bruges som et eksempel til opsætning af IdP; det kan også fungere med andre IdP'er."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:767
msgid ""
"In a multi-tenant Cluster Server deployment each tenant may want to have "
"its own SSO service. Therefore, the Single Sign On is a per-tenant "
"setting."
msgstr "I en multi-tenant Cluster Server-udrulning kan hver lejer ønske at have sin egen SSO-tjeneste. Derfor er Single Sign On en pr. lejer-indstilling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:770
msgid "**Step 1: Register the Cluster Server at IdP**"
msgstr "**Trin 1: Registrer klynge-serveren hos IdP**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:772
msgid ""
"IdP will need to register the Cluster Server as a service provider (SP) "
"by importing the SP's meta data. You will find the Cluster's metadata at "
"the following location (per-tenant setting)."
msgstr "IdP skal registrere Cluster Server som en tjenesteudbyder (SP) ved at importere SP's metadata. Du finder Clusterens metadata på følgende placering (indstilling pr. lejer)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:777
msgid "SERVICE PROVIDER META DATA LINK"
msgstr "SERVICEUDBYDER METADATA LINK"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:779
msgid ""
"We can use the following xml to register the Cluster as an SP at "
"SSOCircle:"
msgstr "Vi kan bruge følgende xml til at registrere klyngen som en SP hos SSOCircle:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:784
msgid "REGISTER CLUSTER SERVER AS AN SP AT SSOCIRCLE"
msgstr "REGISTRER KLYNGESERVER SOM EN SP HOS SSOCIRCLE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:786
msgid "Now at the SSOCircle, need to add a new service provider:"
msgstr "Nu ved SSOCircle skal der tilføjes en ny tjenesteudbyder:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:791
msgid "ADD A SERVICE PROVIDER AT SSOCIRCLE"
msgstr "TILFØJ EN TJENESTEUDBYDER HOS SSOCIRCLE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:793
msgid ""
"In the next screen we can paste in the xml from the Cluster side, set the"
" FQDN to the URL contained within the XML, and check the 3 parameters, "
"the FirstName, LastName and Email."
msgstr "På den næste skærm kan vi indsætte xml'en fra klyngesiden, indstille FQDN til URL'en indeholdt i XML'en og kontrollere de 3 parametre, FirstName, LastName og Email."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:799
msgid "INSERT YOUR METADATA INFORMATION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter03.rst:801
msgid "Now the SSOCircle side of the registration is done."
msgstr "Nu er registreringen på SSOCircle-siden udført."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:803
msgid "**Step 2: Register SSOCircle at the Cluster Server side**"
msgstr "**Trin 2: Registrer SSOCircle på klynge-server siden**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:805
msgid ""
"The IdP registration and SP registration is a two-way I trust you and now"
" you trust me kind of manual setup."
msgstr "IdP-registreringen og SP-registreringen er en gensidig manuel opsætning af typen 'jeg stoler på dig, og nu stoler du på mig'."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:810
msgid "MUTUAL TRUST SP REGISTRATION"
msgstr "INDBYRDES TILLID SP REGISTRERING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:812
msgid ""
"The meta data from the SSOCircle look like this and it can be imported to"
" the Cluster Server."
msgstr "Metadataene fra SSOCircle ser sådan ud, og de kan importeres til klynge-serveren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:817
msgid "EXAMPLE OF SSOCIRCLE META DATA"
msgstr "EKSEMPEL PÅ SSOCIRCLE META DATA"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:819
msgid ""
"Inside the meta data from SSOCircle, you will see there is a HTTP-"
"Redirect URL, that will be the URL we use to register the IdP. And also "
"register the 3 parameters (FirstName, LastName, EmailAddress) from the "
"IdP."
msgstr "Inde i metadataene fra SSOCircle vil du se, at der er en HTTP-Redirect URL, det vil være den URL, vi bruger til at registrere IdP. Og også registrere de 3 parametre (FirstName, LastName, EmailAddress) fra IdP."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:825
msgid "SINGLE SIGN ON SETTINGS"
msgstr "INDSTILLINGER FOR ENKELT LOGON"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:827
msgid "**Step 3: Login at the IdP, but use service at SP**"
msgstr "**Trin 3: Log ind hos IdP, men brug service hos SP**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:829
msgid ""
"As the summary, the IdP and SP register each other's meta data, register "
"each other's URL and parameters. After that, it will be single signon at "
"the IdP side. The login will be at the IdP side, and after login, it will"
" redirect back to the SP side."
msgstr "Som opsummering registrerer IdP og SP hinandens metadata, registrerer hinandens URL og parametre. Derefter vil det være enkelt signon på IdP-siden. Login vil være på IdP-siden, og efter login vil det omdirigere tilbage til SP-siden."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:836
msgid "IDP SIDE SIGLE SIGNON"
msgstr "IDP SIDE ENKELT LOGON"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:839
msgid "File Locking"
msgstr "Fil Låsning"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:841
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``File Locking``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Filspærring``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:843
msgid ""
"File Locking can be accessed from the \"Settings\" menu in the Tenant "
"Dashboard."
msgstr "Filspærring kan tilgås fra \"Indstillinger\"-menuen i Tenant Dashboard."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:848
msgid "FILE LOCKING SETTING"
msgstr "FIL LÅSNINGSINDSTILLING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:850
msgid ""
"After you click the \"Settings\" icon in \"File Locking\" window, here is"
" the screen for the file locking settings details."
msgstr "Efter du klikker på \"Indstillinger\"-ikonet i \"Filspærring\"-vinduet, her er skærmen for detaljerne i filspærringsindstillingerne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:855
msgid "FILE LOCKING SETTINGS"
msgstr "FIL LÅSNINGSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:858
msgid ""
"Settings under file locking applies to all clients which include desktop "
"clients as well as server agent clients."
msgstr "Indstillinger under filspærring gælder for alle klienter, hvilket inkluderer desktopklienter såvel som serveragentklienter."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:861
msgid "**Enable Distributed locking when accessing files**"
msgstr "**Aktivér distribueret låsning, når du tilgår filer**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:863
msgid ""
"In the Cluster Server, there are two ways to lock files, one is manually "
"by right-clicking on a file and select “Check out”. The other way is "
"automatic based on certain binary executables. For example, you can see "
"Microsoft Office executable files like winword.exe and so on."
msgstr "I Cluster Serveren er der to måder at låse filer på, én er manuelt ved at højreklikke på en fil og vælge \"Check ud\". Den anden måde er automatisk baseret på visse binære eksekverbare filer. For eksempel kan du se Microsoft Office eksekverbare filer som winword.exe og så videre."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:866
msgid "**Lock file exclusively**"
msgstr "**Lås filen eksklusivt**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:868
msgid ""
"When enabled, the locked file will be locked exclusively. When disabled, "
"the other user who is trying to open the locked file will be notified "
"about the lock status, but will still be able to open the file."
msgstr "Når det er aktiveret, vil den låste fil være låst eksklusivt. Når det er deaktiveret, vil den anden bruger, der forsøger at åbne den låste fil, blive underrettet om låsestatus, men vil stadig kunne åbne filen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:871
msgid ""
"**Automatically open file in read only mode when file is locked and "
"\"Lock file exclusively\" is not checked.**"
msgstr "**Åbn automatisk fil i skrivebeskyttet tilstand, når filen er låst, og \"Lås filen eksklusivt\" ikke er markeret.**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:873
msgid ""
"When this setting is enabled (default), a second attempt to open a locked"
" file will result in the file opening in read-only mode. If \"Lock file "
"exclusively\" is checked, then second user will not be able to open a "
"locked file."
msgstr "Når denne indstilling er aktiveret (standard), vil et andet forsøg på at åbne en låst fil resultere i, at filen åbnes i skrivebeskyttet tilstand. Hvis \"Lås filen eksklusivt\" er markeret, vil den anden bruger ikke kunne åbne en låst fil."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:876
msgid "**Delay sync until file is unlocked**"
msgstr "**Forsink synkronisering indtil filen er låst op**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:878
msgid ""
"It is recommended to check this setting. Most users have the habit to "
"save files in the middle of editing. You don't want these edits to go "
"every time to the cloud for these intermediate saves. You want to do a "
"save to the cloud at the end like a grand finale. So you can delay sync "
"until the file is unlocked."
msgstr "Det anbefales at kontrollere denne indstilling. De fleste brugere har for vane at gemme filer midt i redigeringen. Du ønsker ikke, at disse redigeringer skal gå til skyen hver gang for disse mellemliggende gemninger. Du ønsker at foretage en gemning til skyen til sidst som en stor finale. Så du kan forsinke synkroniseringen, indtil filen er låst op."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:882
msgid "**Unlock file after file is uploaded**"
msgstr "**Lås fil op efter filen er uploadet**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:884
msgid "After the file is uploaded, unlock the file."
msgstr "Efter filen er uploadet, lås filen op."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:887
msgid "**Lock file natively on network shares**"
msgstr "**Lås filen nativt på netværksandele**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:889
msgid ""
"When a file is locked in the |prodname|, if the file is from an attached "
"network share, the |prodname| lock will be converted into a native file "
"system lock on the network share. This provides locking interoperability "
"between the |prodname| and the underlying file system network share."
msgstr "Når en fil er låst i |prodname|, hvis filen er fra et tilknyttet netværksdrev, vil |prodname| låsen blive konverteret til en nativ filsystemlås på netværksdrevet. Dette giver låseinteroperabilitet mellem |prodname| og det underliggende filsystem netværksdrev."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:892
msgid ""
"**Enable scheduled sync for files with following extensions "
"(i.e.[.mdb][.qbw]) when the file is locked\"**"
msgstr "**Aktivér planlagt synkronisering for filer med følgende filtypenavne (f.eks. [.mdb][.qbw]) når filen er låst\"**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:894
msgid ""
"When files are locked, the client will consolidate multiple changes into "
"one upload event and use Volume Shadow Copy to avoid interfering with "
"applications that are using the files. Typically this applies to database"
" files that are constantly in use and constantly actively writing "
"(commit) to the database file."
msgstr "Når filer er låst, vil klienten konsolidere flere ændringer til én uploadhændelse og bruge Volume Shadow Copy for at undgå at forstyrre applikationer, der bruger filerne. Dette gælder typisk for databasefiler, der konstant er i brug og konstant aktivt skriver (commit) til databasefilen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:897
msgid "**How often to sync the files with above extensions**"
msgstr "**Hvor ofte skal filerne med ovenstående udvidelser synkroniseres**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:899
msgid ""
"This setting allows you to control the interval of synchronization that "
"takes place on the above file extensions."
msgstr "Denne indstilling giver dig mulighed for at kontrollere intervallet for synkronisering, der finder sted for de ovenstående filudvidelser."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:902
msgid "**Apply lock only to the following processes (Lower case)**"
msgstr "**Anvend lås kun til følgende processer (små bogstaver)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:904
msgid ""
"You can specify the processes here for which locking should be applied. "
"By default, locking is enabled for Microsoft Word, Excel, and PowerPoint."
msgstr "Du kan angive processerne her, for hvilke låsning bør anvendes. Som standard er låsning aktiveret for Microsoft Word, Excel og PowerPoint."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:907
msgid "**Apply lock only to the following MAC processes\"(Lower case)**"
msgstr "**Anvend lås kun til følgende MAC-processer\"(Små bogstaver)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:909
msgid ""
"You can specify the processes here for which locking should be applied. "
"By default, locking is enabled for Microsoft Word, Excel, PowerPoint and "
"MAC text editor."
msgstr "Du kan angive processerne her, for hvilke låsning bør anvendes. Som standard er låsning aktiveret for Microsoft Word, Excel, PowerPoint og MAC-tekstbehandler."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:912
msgid ""
"**Locking is disabled for files with the following extensions "
"(i.e.[.xml][.exe])**"
msgstr "**Låsning er deaktiveret for filer med følgende filtypenavne (dvs. [.xml][.exe])**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:914
msgid ""
"You can use this setting to specify which file types will be ignored with"
" regard to the file-locking feature."
msgstr "Du kan bruge denne indstilling til at specificere, hvilke filtyper der vil blive ignoreret med hensyn til fil-låsningsfunktionen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:918
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notifikationer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:920
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Notifications``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Notifikationer``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:922
msgid ""
"The cluster administrator can use the notification manager to help the "
"tenant setup notification events. The tenant administrator will receive "
"email notifications for the events subscribed."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan bruge notifikationsmanageren til at hjælpe lejeren med at opsætte notifikationsbegivenheder. Lejeradministratoren vil modtage e-mail notifikationer for de abonnerede begivenheder."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:928
msgid "NOTIFICATIONS"
msgstr "NOTIFIKATIONER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:936
msgid "NOTIFICATION SETTINGS"
msgstr "NOTIFIKATIONSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:938
msgid "**Send Daily Notification Email**"
msgstr "**Send daglig notifikations-e-mail**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:940
msgid ""
"When set, the system will send email notification daily about the events "
"you are interested (Select below)."
msgstr "Når den er indstillet, vil systemet dagligt sende e-mail notifikation om de begivenheder, du er interesseret i (vælg nedenfor)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:942
msgid "File Changes"
msgstr "Filændringer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:944
msgid "Users approaching the storage quota limit"
msgstr "Brugere nærmer sig grænsen for lagerkvoten"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:945
msgid "Notification threshold"
msgstr "Notifikationstærskel"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:947
msgid "**Notify tenant admin when member's sync task failed or paused**"
msgstr "**Underret lejerens admin når medlemmets synkroniseringsopgave fejler eller pauses**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:949
msgid "**Notify tenant admin when a member shares a folder**"
msgstr "**Underret lejeradmin, når et medlem deler en mappe**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:951
msgid "**Notify me when a user account is locked out**"
msgstr "**Giv mig besked, når en brugerkonto bliver låst**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:953
msgid "**Do not show file change notifications on Windows and Mac client**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke filændringsmeddelelser på Windows- og Mac-klient**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:955
msgid ""
"**Send notification to these emails in addition to tenant admin's email "
"(email;email2)**"
msgstr "**Send notifikation til disse e-mails ud over lejeradminens e-mail (email;email2)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:957
msgid "This is used for additional administrators to receive email notification."
msgstr "Dette bruges til, at ekstra administratorer kan modtage e-mail notifikation."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:960
msgid "Shared File/Folder"
msgstr "Delt Fil/Mappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:965
msgid "SHARES SUBSCRIPTIONS"
msgstr "AKTIEABONNEMENTER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:967
msgid "Notification regarding modified/downloaded shared files and folders."
msgstr "Notifikation vedrørende ændrede/downloadede delte filer og mapper."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:971
msgid "Team Folder"
msgstr "Team Mappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:976
msgid "TEAM FOLDER SUBSCRIPTIONS"
msgstr "ABONNEMENTER PÅ TEAMMAPPER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:978
msgid ""
"Administrators can use this setting to receive notifications when changes"
" occur in Team Folders."
msgstr "Administratorer kan bruge denne indstilling til at modtage notifikationer, når der sker ændringer i Team-mapper."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:982
msgid "User Account & Security"
msgstr "Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:985
msgid "Tenant Administrators"
msgstr "Lejeradministratorer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:987
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > "
"``Tenant Administrators``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Tenant Administratorer``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:989
msgid ""
"In the administrator information page, the cluster administrator can help"
" the tenant manager change their email and user name if they need to, and"
" to also setup delegated administrators."
msgstr "På administratorens informationsside kan klyngeadministratoren hjælpe lejeradministratoren med at ændre deres e-mail og brugernavn, hvis de har brug for det, og også opsætte delegerede administratorer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:991
msgid ""
"The delegated administrators that are setup at the cluster level are "
"users who are already in the Cluster Server and will be helping out the "
"management of this specific tenant. Access these settings by clicking "
"\"User Account & Security\" from \"Settings\" section, and choose the "
"\"Tenant Administrators\" icon. You can define a group of users here to "
"delegate the administration of tenants to other users."
msgstr "De delegerede administratorer, der er opsat på klyngeniveau, er brugere, som allerede er i Cluster Serveren og vil hjælpe med forvaltningen af denne specifikke lejer. Tilgå disse indstillinger ved at klikke på \"Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed\" fra \"Indstillinger\"-sektionen, og vælg ikonet \"Lejeradministratorer\". Du kan definere en gruppe af brugere her for at delegere administrationen af lejere til andre brugere."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:996
msgid "TENANT ADMINISTRATORS"
msgstr "LEJERADMINISTRATORER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1001
msgid ""
"Delegated administrators have two different roles. First of all, they are"
" not the default administrator in the tenant so normally they are just "
"normal team users in the tenant."
msgstr "Delegerede administratorer har to forskellige roller. For det første er de ikke standardadministratoren i lejer, så normalt er de bare almindelige teambrugere i lejeren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1005
msgid ""
"However, they can elevate themselves into the admin role by clicking the "
"elevation icon that is available to delegated administrators."
msgstr "De kan dog ophøje sig selv til admin-rollen ved at klikke på forfremmelsesikonet, der er tilgængeligt for delegerede administratorer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1009
msgid "User Account"
msgstr "Brugerkonto"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1011
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > ``User "
"Account``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Brugerkonto``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1013
msgid ""
"This is how \"User Account\" settings looks when \"2-Step Verification is"
" not turned on by the Cluster Manager."
msgstr "Sådan ser \"Brugerkonto\" indstillingerne ud, når \"2-trinsbekræftelse\" ikke er aktiveret af klyngeadministratoren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1018
msgid "USER ACCOUNT SETTINGS"
msgstr "BRUGERKONTOINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1022
msgid "**Allow creation of guest user**"
msgstr "**Tillad oprettelse af gæstebruger**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1024
msgid ""
"When enabled (default), you will allow creating of guest user when team "
"user share files or folders with external users. When disabled, the "
"file/folder sharing is limited to regular users only or anonymous users "
"only."
msgstr "Når aktiveret (standard), vil du tillade oprettelse af gæstebruger, når teambruger deler filer eller mapper med eksterne brugere. Når deaktiveret, er deling af filer/mapper begrænset til kun almindelige brugere eller anonyme brugere."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1027
msgid "Account Info"
msgstr "Kontooplysninger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1028
msgid "**Allow user to edit account info**"
msgstr "**Tillad bruger at redigere kontooplysninger**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1030
msgid ""
"When enabled (default), this setting allows users to edit their account "
"information."
msgstr "Når aktiveret (standard), tillader denne indstilling brugere at redigere deres kontoinformation."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1032
msgid "**Allow proxied AD user to change native password (Non AD Password)**"
msgstr "**Tillad proxyet AD-bruger at ændre oprindeligt password (Ikke AD Password)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1034
msgid ""
"Proxied AD user refers to Active Directory users from remote server agent"
" machine. Normally the initial password and changed password are "
"synchronized from the server agent side periodically so the end user is "
"always using the same Active Directory credentials to log in. However, "
"there may be cases when you want the user to break away from the old "
"Active Directory and setup credential natively on |prodname|."
msgstr "Proxied AD-bruger henviser til Active Directory-brugere fra fjernserveragentmaskinen. Normalt synkroniseres det oprindelige kodeord og det ændrede kodeord periodisk fra serveragentens side, så endbrugeren altid bruger de samme Active Directory-legitimationsoplysninger til at logge ind. Der kan dog være tilfælde, hvor du ønsker, at brugeren skal bryde væk fra den gamle Active Directory og opsætte legitimationsoplysninger lokalt på |prodname|."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1041
msgid "2-Step Verification"
msgstr "2-trinsbekræftelse"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1045 ../../chapter03.rst:1088
msgid "USER ACCOUNT SETTINGS (Cont.)"
msgstr "BRUGERKONTOINDSTILLINGER (fortsat)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1048
msgid "**Enforce 2-Step Verification on users**"
msgstr "**Gennemtving 2-trinsbekræftelse på brugere**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1050
msgid ""
"Enforce 2-step verification will force the users to setup 2-step "
"verification via Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, Amazon "
"MFA or any app that supports the same 2-step verification algorithm."
msgstr "Gennemtvingelse af 2-trinsbekræftelse vil tvinge brugerne til at opsætte 2-trinsbekræftelse via Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, Amazon MFA eller enhver app, der understøtter den samme 2-trinsbekræftelsesalgoritme."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1052
msgid "**Do not enforce 2-Step Verification on Windows client**"
msgstr "**Tving ikke 2-trinsbekræftelse igennem på Windows-klient**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1054 ../../chapter03.rst:1062
msgid "Tuning on windows client whether to enforce 2-step verification"
msgstr "Indstilling på Windows-klient om at håndhæve totrinsbekræftelse"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1056
msgid "**Do not enforce 2-Step Verification on Mac client**"
msgstr "**Tving ikke 2-trinsbekræftelse igennem på Mac-klient**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1058
msgid "Tuning on mac client whether to enforce 2-step verification"
msgstr "Indstilling på Mac-klienten om at håndhæve totrinsbekræftelse"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1060
msgid "**Do not enforce 2-Step Verification on Mobile client**"
msgstr "**Tving ikke 2-trinsbekræftelse igennem på mobilklienten**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1064
msgid "**Disable 2-Step Verification**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver totrinsbekræftelse**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1066
msgid ""
"Disable 2-step verification. One possible use case is when 2-step "
"verification is no longer needed or 2-step verification needs to be "
"disabled temporarily."
msgstr "Deaktiver totrinsbekræftelse. Et muligt brugstilfælde er, når totrinsbekræftelse ikke længere er nødvendig, eller totrinsbekræftelse skal deaktiveres midlertidigt."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1069
msgid "**Do NOT enforce 2-Step Verification on guest users**"
msgstr "**Tving IKKE 2-trinsbekræftelse på gæstebrugere**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1071
msgid ""
"Guest users may have a set of credentials to login to receive shared "
"files and folders. This policy define whether to enforce 2-step "
"verification for them."
msgstr "Gæstebrugere kan have et sæt legitimationsoplysninger for at logge ind og modtage delte filer og mapper. Denne politik definerer, om der skal håndhæves totrinsbekræftelse for dem."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1074
msgid "**Disable option to request 2-step verification code by email**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver mulighed for at anmode om 2-trins bekræftelseskode via e-mail**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1076
msgid ""
"If user doesn't have the 2-step verification app on the mobile device, "
"the alternative is to send the code to user's email."
msgstr "Hvis brugeren ikke har 2-trins verifikationsappen på mobil enheden, er alternativet at sende koden til brugerens e-mail."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1078
msgid "**Do not send verification code in email subject**"
msgstr "**Send ikke bekræftelseskode i e-mail emnet**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1080
msgid ""
"If the code has to be sent over email, don't send the code in the subject"
" line."
msgstr "Hvis koden skal sendes over e-mail, skal du ikke sende koden i emnelinjen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1084
msgid "Login Control"
msgstr "Login Kontrol"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1090
msgid "**Account Lockout Threshold (0 - never lockout)**"
msgstr "**Kontospærringstærskel (0 - aldrig spærre)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1092
msgid ""
"You can specify the Account lockout threshold limit here. The limit "
"specified will be the number of invalid logon attempts that will be "
"allowed before an account is locked out. Default is 0 (never lockout)."
msgstr "Du kan angive grænsen for konto udelukkelsestærskel her. Den angivne grænse vil være antallet af ugyldige loginforsøg, der vil blive tilladt, før en konto bliver låst. Standard er 0 (aldrig låse ude)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1094
msgid ""
"**Enforce progressively longer waiting times after invalid logon "
"attempts**"
msgstr "**Håndhæv gradvist længere ventetider efter ugyldige loginforsøg**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1096
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. Under login control, you can also enforce "
"progressively longer waiting times after invalid logon attempts."
msgstr "Deaktiveret som standard. Under login kontrol kan du også håndhæve gradvist længere ventetider efter ugyldige loginforsøg."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1098
msgid "**Send email notification when logging in from a new location/device**"
msgstr "**Send e-mail notifikation når der logges ind fra en ny placering/enhed**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1100
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. Another setting under login control is the 'Send "
"email notification when login from new location/device'. This setting "
"will send an email to users whenever a different device or location is "
"used to login."
msgstr "Deaktiveret som standard. En anden indstilling under login kontrol er 'Send e-mail notifikation, når der logges ind fra en ny placering/enhed'. Denne indstilling vil sende en e-mail til brugerne, hver gang der logges ind fra en anden enhed eller placering."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1102
msgid "**Native Client Token Timeout (days, 0 - never timeout)**"
msgstr "**Native Client Token Timeout (dage, 0 - aldrig timeout)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1104
msgid ""
"Determines if and when the Native Client Token will timeout, in days. "
"Default is 15 days."
msgstr "Bestemmer om og hvornår Native Client Token udløber, i dage. Standard er 15 dage."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1106
msgid "**Web Browser Session Timeout (minutes, 0 - never timeout)**"
msgstr "**Webbrowser-sessionstimeout (minutter, 0 - aldrig timeout)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1108
msgid ""
"Determines if and when the Web Browser Session timeout, in minutes, will "
"occur. Default is 120 minutes."
msgstr "Bestemmer om og hvornår webbrowser-sessionens timeout, i minutter, vil finde sted. Standard er 120 minutter."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1112
msgid "Password Policy"
msgstr "Adgangskodepolitik"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1114
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > "
"``Password Policy``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Adgangskodepolitik``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1116
msgid "Here you can adjust your password policy settings."
msgstr "Her kan du justere dine indstillinger for adgangskodepolitik."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1121
msgid "PASSWORD POLICY SETTINGS"
msgstr "KODEORDSPOLITIKINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1123
msgid "**Enforce password policy for non-AD users**"
msgstr "**Håndhæv adgangskodepolitik for ikke-AD-brugere**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1125
msgid ""
"By default, non-AD users are not enforced to use this policy when setting"
" their passowrd. Enable this to enforce the following rules."
msgstr "Som standard er ikke-AD-brugere ikke tvunget til at følge denne politik, når de opsætter deres adgangskode. Aktivér dette for at håndhæve følgende regler."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1127
msgid "**Minimum password length**"
msgstr "**Minimum adgangskode længde**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1129
msgid ""
"Require the password to contain a certain number of characters as a "
"minimum. Default is 8."
msgstr "Kræver, at adgangskoden indeholder et bestemt antal tegn som minimum. Standard er 8."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1131
msgid "**Users must change password every n days (0 - never)**"
msgstr "**Brugere skal skifte adgangskode hver n dag(e) (0 - aldrig)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1133
msgid ""
"Force users to change their passwords every so many days. Default is 0 "
"(never)."
msgstr "Tving brugerne til at ændre deres adgangskoder hver så mange dage. Standard er 0 (aldrig)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1135
msgid "**Must contain upper case characters**"
msgstr "**Skal indeholde store bogstaver**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1137
msgid ""
"Enforce the use of upper-case characters in the password. Default is "
"enabled."
msgstr "Gennemtving brugen af store bogstaver i adgangskoden. Standard er aktiveret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1139
msgid "**Must contain lower case characters**"
msgstr "**Skal indeholde små bogstaver**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1141
msgid ""
"Enforce the use of lower-case characters in the password. Default is "
"enabled."
msgstr "Gennemtving brugen af små bogstaver i adgangskoden. Standard er aktiveret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1143
msgid "**Must contain base10 digits (0-9)**"
msgstr "**Skal indeholde basistal 10 cifre (0-9)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1145
msgid "Enforce the use of base10 digits in the password. Default is enabled."
msgstr "Gennemtving brugen af base10-cifre i adgangskoden. Standard er aktiveret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1147
msgid "**Must contain non-alphanumeric characters: (e.g., ~ ! @ # $ % ^ &)**"
msgstr "**Skal indeholde ikke-alfanumeriske tegn: (f.eks. ~ ! @ # $ % ^ &)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1149
msgid ""
"Enforce the use of special non-alphanumeric characters when creating a "
"password. Default is enabled."
msgstr "Gennemtving brugen af specielle ikke-alfanumeriske tegn, når du opretter en adgangskode. Standard er aktiveret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1154
msgid "Access Control"
msgstr "Adgangskontrol"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1156
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > "
"``Access Control``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Adgangskontrol``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1158
msgid ""
"In the Admin Access Control, the cluster administrator can decide the "
"division of work between cluster administrators and the specific tenant "
"administrator. A lot of times, the cluster administrator will help with "
"setting things up. In this case, the cluster administrator can take away "
"some of the administrative work from the tenant administrator."
msgstr "I Admin Access Control kan klyngeadministratoren bestemme arbejdsfordelingen mellem klyngeadministratorer og den specifikke lejeradministrator. Mange gange vil klyngeadministratoren hjælpe med at sætte tingene op. I dette tilfælde kan klyngeadministratoren overtage noget af det administrative arbejde fra lejeradministratoren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1162
msgid ""
"For example, if the cluster administrator is a Managed Service Provider "
"(MSP), the tenant admin can be an admin user from a specific client "
"(customer)."
msgstr "For eksempel, hvis klyngeadministratoren er en Managed Service Provider (MSP), kan lejeradministratoren være en administrativ bruger fra en specifik klient (kunde)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1164
msgid ""
"Or, if the cluster administrator is an enterprise IT directory, the "
"tenant admin can be a specific division of the enterprise."
msgstr "Eller hvis klyngeadministratoren er en virksomheds IT-afdeling, kan lejeradministratoren være en specifik division af virksomheden."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1169
msgid "ACCESS CONTROL SETTINGS"
msgstr "ADGANGSKONTROLINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1171
msgid "**Allow tenant to attach external cloud storage**"
msgstr "**Tillad lejer at tilkoble ekstern cloudlagring**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1173
msgid ""
"If checked, in the tenant administrator's management console, the "
"\"Storage Manager\" will show and allow tenant administrator to mount "
"(attach) external storage."
msgstr "Hvis markeret, vil \"Storage Manager\" i lejemålsadministratorens styringskonsol vise og tillade lejemålsadministratoren at montere (tilkoble) ekstern lagring."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1175
msgid ""
"If the cluster administrator is setting it up for the tenant, the cluster"
" administrator can take away this privilege."
msgstr "Hvis klyngeadministratoren opsætter det for lejeren, kan klyngeadministratoren fjerne dette privilegium."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1178
msgid "**Allow tenant to edit branding settings**"
msgstr "**Tillad lejer at redigere brandingindstillinger**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1180
msgid ""
"The Cluster administrator can decide whether to allow tenant "
"administrator to have its own branding."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan beslutte, om lejeradministratoren skal have sit eget branding."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1183
msgid "**Do not show GDPR consent form**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke GDPR samtykkeformular**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1185
msgid ""
"The EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is the most important "
"change in data privacy regulation in 20 years.  There are regulations "
"about collecting user information and software needs to provide consent "
"form. If you have customers in the EU, it is recommended to show the "
"consent form."
msgstr "EU's Generelle Databeskyttelsesforordning (GDPR) er den vigtigste ændring i databeskyttelseslovgivningen i 20 år. Der er regler om indsamling af brugeroplysninger, og softwaren skal tilbyde samtykkeformular. Hvis du har kunder i EU, anbefales det at vise samtykkeformularen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1189
msgid "**Allow tenant to increase user plan automatically**"
msgstr "**Tillad lejer at øge brugerplanen automatisk**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1191
msgid ""
"The Cluster administrator can decide whether to allow the tenant to grow "
"the user count automatically."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan beslutte, om det skal være muligt for lejeren at øge antallet af brugere automatisk."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1194
msgid "**Multi AD Domain Support**"
msgstr "**Understøttelse af flere AD-domæner**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1196
msgid "Support multiple Active Directories in a single tenant (current tenant)."
msgstr "Understøtter flere Active Directories i en enkelt tenant (nuværende tenant)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1198
msgid ""
"Multiple Active Directory forests support. This is not a common option "
"because most of the time, the tenant has one forest (which can have "
"multiple sub domains). In the case when the tenant has several Active "
"Directory domains that are not related, multiple LDAP connection can be "
"set up this way."
msgstr "Understøttelse af flere Active Directory-skove. Dette er ikke en almindelig mulighed, da lejeren for det meste har én skov (som kan have flere underdomæner). I tilfældet hvor lejeren har flere Active Directory-domæner, der ikke er relaterede, kan flere LDAP-forbindelser opsættes på denne måde."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1202
msgid ""
"If you have single AD forest but contains multiple sub-domain AD domain "
"controller, you don't need to turn on Multi-AD support. Instead, you just"
" point the LDAP to the root forest domain controller and the root forest "
"domain controller will find and identify the sub-domains."
msgstr "Hvis du har en enkelt AD-skov, men indeholder flere underdomæne AD-domænecontrollere, behøver du ikke at aktivere Multi-AD-understøttelse. I stedet peger du bare LDAP til rodfæstedomænecontrolleren, og rodfæstedomænecontrolleren vil finde og identificere underdomænerne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1205
msgid "**View and edit group policy**"
msgstr "**Vis og rediger gruppepolitik**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1207
msgid ""
"The Cluster administrator can decide whether to show the group policy "
"section to this tenant."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan beslutte, om gruppepolitiksektionen skal vises for denne lejer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1210
msgid "**Disable file/folder sharing**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver fil-/mappe-deling**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1212
msgid "Disable file and folder sharing from tenant level."
msgstr "Deaktiver fil- og mappe-deling fra tenant-niveau."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1215
msgid "**Hide migration option**"
msgstr "**Skjul migrationsindstilling**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1217
msgid ""
"Migration option refers to migrating remote file server(s) from remote "
"customer location(s) to the Cluster Server. Not all clients (customers) "
"have remote file servers, so this tenant level option may not apply all "
"the time."
msgstr "Migrationsmulighed henviser til migration af fjernfilserver(e) fra fjern kundelokation(er) til Cluster Serveren. Ikke alle klienter (kunder) har fjernfilservere, så denne mulighed på lejemålsniveau er ikke altid relevant."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1220
msgid ""
"**Show Data-At-Rest Encryption (DARE) configuration page (Requires empty "
"storage container)**"
msgstr "**Vis konfigurationssiden for Data-At-Rest Encryption (DARE) (Kræver tom opbevaringscontainer)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1222
msgid ""
"If the tenant has the required encryption of the data in the cloud "
"(Cluster Server side), a DARE configuration page can be shown upon the "
"first usage to set it up."
msgstr "Hvis lejeren har den nødvendige kryptering af dataene i skyen (Cluster Server-siden), kan en DARE-konfigurationsside vises ved første brug for at opsætte det."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1227
msgid "**Allow tenant to edit LDAP setting**"
msgstr "**Tillad lejer at redigere LDAP-indstilling**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1229
msgid ""
"In the case the tenant's infrastructure is in the same LAN (Local Area "
"Network) as the Cluster Manager, the tenant's Active Directory can be "
"directly connected via LDAP to the Cluster Server."
msgstr "I tilfældet hvor lejerens infrastruktur er i samme LAN (Local Area Network) som Cluster Manager, kan lejerens Active Directory direkte forbindes via LDAP til Cluster Serveren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1231
msgid ""
"If the cluster administrator is setting it up for the tenant, cluster "
"administrator can take away this privilege."
msgstr "Hvis klyngeadministratoren opsætter det for lejeren, kan klyngeadministratoren fjerne dette privilegium."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1235
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sikkerhed"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1236
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > "
"``Security``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Sikkerhed``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1242
msgid "SECURITY SETTINGS"
msgstr "SIKKERHEDSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1244
msgid "**Allow Cluster Admin to manage my tenant**"
msgstr "**Tillad Cluster Admin at administrere min tenant**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1246
msgid ""
"When enabled, the cluster-admin will be able to use the “Manage Tenant” "
"link to manage the tenant in the tenant manager. This is very convenient "
"for cluster administrators (typically system administrators from service "
"providers) to provide management work to the tenant."
msgstr "Når aktiveret, vil cluster-administratoren kunne bruge \"Administrer Tenant\"-linket til at administrere tenanten i tenant manageren. Dette er meget bekvemt for clusteradministratorer (typisk systemadministratorer fra tjenesteudbydere) for at yde administrationsarbejde til tenanten."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1249
msgid "**Enable Authenticating User with Google Apps Credentials**"
msgstr "**Aktivér godkendelse af bruger med Google Apps-legitimationsoplysninger**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1251
msgid "When enabled, users can login using Google Apps credentials."
msgstr "Når det er aktiveret, kan brugere logge ind med Google Apps-legitimationsoplysninger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1254
msgid ""
"**When delegate admin login via server agent, impersonate as tenant "
"admin**"
msgstr "**Når en delegeret administrator logger ind via serveragenten, skal der foretages en personificering som tenant-administrator**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1256
msgid ""
"Server agents typically need to sync to the default tenant administrator."
" It is recommended when a delegate administrator setup a server agent, it"
" needs to impersonate the default tenant administrator."
msgstr "Serveragenter skal typisk synkronisere med standardlejeradministratoren. Det anbefales, at når en delegeret administrator opsætter en serveragent, skal den efterligne standardlejeradministratoren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1259
msgid "**File upload and download must go through worker node**"
msgstr "**Filoverførsel og download skal gå gennem arbejder node**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1261
msgid "(This setting may only be available from cluster administrator side)"
msgstr "(Denne indstilling kan kun være tilgængelig fra clusteradministratorens side)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1263
msgid ""
"For Amazon S3 type of cloud storage/object storage, it is recommended NOT"
" to force file upload and download going through worker nodes, because "
"Amazon S3 is good for offload the upload/download between the access "
"clients and the backend Amazon S3 storage. However, for OpenStack Swift "
"storage, depending on how it is set up, you may want to turn this on to "
"force File Upload/Download going through worker node for security "
"reasons."
msgstr "For Amazon S3-type cloud storage/object storage anbefales det IKKE at tvinge filupload og -download til at gå gennem arbejderknuder, fordi Amazon S3 er godt til at aflaste upload/download mellem adgangsklienterne og den bagerste Amazon S3-lagring. Dog, for OpenStack Swift-lagring, afhængigt af hvordan det er opsat, kan du ønske at aktivere dette for at tvinge Fil Upload/Download til at gå gennem arbejderknode af sikkerhedsmæssige årsager."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1265
msgid ""
"This setting may be checked by default. However, based on your "
"configuration, it may not need to be checked."
msgstr "Denne indstilling kan være markeret som standard. Men baseret på din konfiguration, er det måske ikke nødvendigt at have den markeret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1267
msgid ""
"For example, if you are using file server network share as the storage "
"location, the upload and download has to go through worker node anyway, "
"so there is no need to check this checkbox."
msgstr "For eksempel, hvis du bruger netværksdeling på filserver som lagerplads, skal upload og download under alle omstændigheder gå gennem arbejderknuden, så der er ingen grund til at markere dette afkrydsningsfelt."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1269
msgid ""
"There may be some situations  that this setting must be checked. For "
"example, you may be using native object storage such as Amazon S3 for "
"storage. However, your company policy may disable direct access to Amazon"
" S3. So in this case, you will have to route traffic through the worker "
"node."
msgstr "Der kan være situationer, hvor denne indstilling skal kontrolleres. For eksempel kan du bruge native objektlagring som Amazon S3 til opbevaring. Men hvis din virksomhedspolitik forbyder direkte adgang til Amazon S3, skal du i dette tilfælde dirigere trafikken gennem arbejderknuden."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1272
msgid "Home Directory"
msgstr "Hjemmemappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1274
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > ``Home "
"Directory``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Hjemmemappe``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1279
msgid "HOME DIRECTORY SETTINGS"
msgstr "HJEMMEMAPPEINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1281
msgid "**Default Storage quota**"
msgstr "**Standard lagerkvota**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1283
msgid ""
"This policy will not affect existing user and their quota. It can affect "
"a newly created user for the default storage quota."
msgstr "Denne politik vil ikke påvirke eksisterende brugere og deres kvote. Den kan påvirke en nyoprettet bruger for standard lagerkvoten."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1285
msgid "**Create default folders**"
msgstr "**Opret standardmapper**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1287
msgid ""
"When the new user account is provisioned, the default root folder is "
"empty."
msgstr "Når den nye brugerkonto er oprettet, er standardrodmappe tom."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1289
msgid ""
"“Create default folder (Documents, Pictures)” will make the root folder "
"look less empty and more user-friendly. This hints at how to organize "
"files and folders in the cloud."
msgstr "Oprettelse af standardmappe (Dokumenter, Billeder) vil gøre rodmappe mindre tom og mere brugervenlig. Dette antyder, hvordan man organiserer filer og mapper i skyen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1293
msgid ""
"When unchecked, the user home drive space will be allocated from "
"enterprise storage. When checked, existing user home drives will be "
"automatically published from Active Directory."
msgstr "Når den ikke er markeret, vil brugerens hjemdrevs plads blive tildelt fra virksomhedens lagerplads. Når den er markeret, vil eksisterende brugerhjemdrev automatisk blive offentliggjort fra Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1295
msgid "**Mount user's home drive as a top level folder**"
msgstr "**Monter brugerens hjemmedrev som en topniveau mappe**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1297
msgid ""
"Without this option, the user's home drive from active directory mapping "
"will become the root folder in |prodname|. However, if the user also have"
" network shares mapped into |prodname|, those network shares will appear "
"as top level folders. So in this use case, mapping user's home folder as "
"a top folder is more in parallel to the other network shares."
msgstr "Uden denne mulighed vil brugerens hjemmedrev fra Active Directory-mapping blive rodmappen i |prodname|. Hvis brugeren dog også har netværksdrev mappede ind i |prodname|, vil disse netværksdrev fremstå som topniveaumapper. Så i dette tilfælde er det at mappe brugerens hjemmemappe som en topmappe mere parallelt med de andre netværksdrev."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1303
msgid "Azure AD"
msgstr "Azure AD"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1305
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``User Account & Security`` > ``Azure"
" AD``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Brugerkonto & Sikkerhed`` > ``Azure AD``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1307
msgid ""
"Azure AD integration allows users to use their Azure AD credentials to "
"login to the Cluster Server, including web portal and native clients."
msgstr "Azure AD-integration gør det muligt for brugere at bruge deres Azure AD-legitimationsoplysninger til at logge ind på Cluster Server, herunder webportal og native klienter."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1309
msgid ""
"You will still need to create Azure AD users as if they were local "
"Cluster users first. After that, you can enable Azure AD integration."
msgstr "Du skal stadig oprette Azure AD-brugere, som om de var lokale Cluster-brugere først. Derefter kan du aktivere Azure AD-integration."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1311
msgid ""
"To enable Azure AD integration, you will need to create an Azure AD "
"native client application."
msgstr "For at aktivere Azure AD-integration skal du oprette en Azure AD-native klientapplikation."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1317
msgid "ENABLE AZURE AD INTEGRATION"
msgstr "AKTIVER AZURE AD-INTEGRATION"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1319
msgid "You will need the client id from the Azure Native Client Application"
msgstr "Du skal bruge klient-id'et fra Azure Native Client Application"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1324
msgid "AZURE CLIENT ID FIELD"
msgstr "AZURE KLIENT-ID FELT"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1326
msgid ""
"You will give the Azure Native Client Application full read permission to"
" the following two items"
msgstr "Du vil give Azure Native Client Application fuld læserettighed til de følgende to elementer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1329
msgid "Azure Active Directory"
msgstr "Azure Active Directory"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1330
msgid "Microsoft Graph API"
msgstr "Microsoft Graph API"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1335
msgid "AZURE PERMISSIONS TO OTHER APPLICATIONS"
msgstr "AZURE TILLADELSER TIL ANDRE APPLIKATIONER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1337
msgid "You will also need the domain name"
msgstr "Du vil også have brug for domænenavnet"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1342
msgid "AZURE DOMAIN SETTING"
msgstr "AZURE DOMÆNEINDSTILLING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1347
msgid "Ransomware Protection"
msgstr "Ransomware-beskyttelse"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1350
msgid "Anti Virus Settings"
msgstr "Anti Virus Indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1352
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Ransomware Protection`` >  "
"``Settings``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Ransomware-beskyttelse`` > ``Indstillinger``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1357
msgid "ANTI VIRUS SETTINGS"
msgstr "ANTIVIRUSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1359
msgid ""
"**Only allow the following processes to update files (empty: allow all, "
"separate using semicolon (;), i.e. winword.exe;excel.exe)**"
msgstr "**Tillad kun de følgende processer at opdatere filer (tom: tillad alle, adskil med semikolon (;), dvs. winword.exe;excel.exe)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1361
msgid ""
"This is a white list of applications that are allowed to update files. "
"The applications that are not in the list will not be able to upload "
"files."
msgstr "Dette er en hvid liste over applikationer, der har tilladelse til at opdatere filer. Applikationer, der ikke er på listen, vil ikke kunne uploade filer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1363
msgid ""
"**The following executables will not be allowed to open files directly "
"from the cloud drive (i.e. qbw32.exe;excel.exe)**"
msgstr "**Følgende eksekverbare filer vil ikke være tilladt at åbne filer direkte fra cloud-drevet (dvs. qbw32.exe;excel.exe)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1365
msgid ""
"This is the opposite of the above policy. The applications in this list "
"will be denied."
msgstr "Dette er det modsatte af ovenstående politik. Applikationerne på denne liste vil blive nægtet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1367
msgid "**Disable a device if the device changes more than n files in 10 minutes**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver en enhed, hvis enheden ændrer mere end n filer på 10 minutter**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1369
msgid ""
"When users are using the cloud drive in a normal way. Human speed will "
"not be able to generate large amount of file upload."
msgstr "Når brugere anvender cloud-drevet på normal vis, vil menneskelig hastighed ikke være i stand til at generere en stor mængde filuploads."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1371
msgid "**Ignore the following processes when applying the above policy**"
msgstr "**Ignorer de følgende processer, når du anvender ovenstående politik**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1373
msgid ""
"This is a white list of files that will not be monitored for the activity"
" described above. (e.g., qbw32.exe; excel.exe)"
msgstr "Dette er en hvid liste over filer, der ikke vil blive overvåget for den ovenfor beskrevne aktivitet. (f.eks. qbw32.exe; excel.exe)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1375
msgid ""
"**Disable uploading of files whose named contain the following text "
"patterns**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver upload af filer, hvis navne indeholder følgende tekst mønstre**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1377
msgid ""
"When file name text contains the following strings, the files will not be"
" uploaded. (e.g., badfile1; badfile2)"
msgstr "Når filnavneteksten indeholder følgende strenge, vil filerne ikke blive uploadet. (f.eks. badfile1; badfile2)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1379
msgid ""
"**Disable uploading of files whose names start with the following "
"strings**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver upload af filer, hvis navne starter med følgende strenge**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1381
msgid ""
"When the starting text of files contain these strings, the files will not"
" be uploaded. (e.g., bad1; bad2)"
msgstr "Når startteksten af filer indeholder disse strenge, vil filerne ikke blive uploadet. (f.eks. bad1; bad2)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1383
msgid "**Disable uploading of files whose names end with the following strings**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver upload af filer, hvis navne slutter med følgende strenge**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1385
msgid ""
"When the ending text of files contain these strings, the files will not "
"be uploaded. (e.g., bad1; bad2)"
msgstr "Når slutteksten i filer indeholder disse strenge, vil filerne ikke blive uploadet. (f.eks., bad1; bad2)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1389
msgid "Data Leak Protection"
msgstr "Datalækagebeskyttelse"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1394
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Data Leak Protection`` >  "
"``Sharing``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Databeskyttelse`` > ``Deling``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1400
msgid "SHARING SETTINGS"
msgstr "DELING INDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1402
msgid ""
"**Users must log in to access the content in 'Files shared with me' "
"folder**"
msgstr "**Brugere skal logge ind for at få adgang til indholdet i mappen 'Filer delt med mig'**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1404
msgid ""
"When sharing files and folders with users, you can force the sharing to "
"create guest accounts for users that are not already in the system. It is"
" more secure when asking the receiver of the share to sign in to receive "
"shared items. This disables anonymous sharing."
msgstr "Når du deler filer og mapper med brugere, kan du tvinge delingen til at oprette gæstekonti for brugere, der endnu ikke er i systemet. Det er mere sikkert at bede modtageren af delingen om at logge ind for at modtage de delte elementer. Dette deaktiverer anonym deling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1406
msgid ""
"If this setting is not enabled, users can share files and folders to an "
"outside email address without requiring outside users to create a guest "
"user account."
msgstr "Hvis denne indstilling ikke er aktiveret, kan brugere dele filer og mapper med en ekstern e-mailadresse uden at kræve, at eksterne brugere opretter en gæstebrugerkonto."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1409
msgid "**Disable user's ability to share home directory content externally**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver brugerens mulighed for at dele indhold i hjemmemappen eksternt**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1411
msgid ""
"This feature disables the ability for a regular user to share home "
"directory contents for security reasons."
msgstr "Denne funktion deaktiverer muligheden for en almindelig bruger til at dele indhold i hjemmemappen af sikkerhedsmæssige årsager."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1414
msgid "**Enable Internal Public Share URL**"
msgstr "**Aktivér intern offentlig delings-URL**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1416
msgid ""
"If you have an internal public share you can use this setting to enable "
"it."
msgstr "Hvis du har en intern offentlig deling, kan du bruge denne indstilling til at aktivere den."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1418
msgid ""
"When this is enabled, it will use the Internal URL property to generate a"
" web link for shared file/folder."
msgstr "Når dette er aktiveret, vil det bruge egenskaben Intern URL til at generere et web link for den delte fil/mappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1421
msgid "**Disable Public Link**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver offentligt link**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1423
msgid "This will disable the public web link feature in the sharing dialog."
msgstr "Dette vil deaktivere funktionen med offentligt web link i delingsdialogen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1426
msgid "**Show guest user creation option**"
msgstr "**Vis mulighed for oprettelse af gæstebruger**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1428
msgid ""
"When enabled this shows the guest user creation option which you will see"
" when 'Sharing' a file or folder by email. This is how you can provide "
"full edit capability to a guest user, as they must be logged in to modify"
" a file or folder in the |prodname|."
msgstr "Når denne er aktiveret, vises muligheden for oprettelse af gæstebruger, som du vil se, når du 'deler' en fil eller mappe via e-mail. Dette er måden, du kan give en gæstebruger fuld redigeringskapacitet, da de skal være logget ind for at kunne ændre en fil eller mappe i |prodname|."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1431
msgid ""
"**Enable distribution group detection in file/folder sharing's user "
"interface**"
msgstr "**Aktivér detektion af distributionsgruppe i brugergrænsefladen for deling af filer/mapper**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1433
msgid ""
"With active directory integration, sometimes you want to share files and "
"folders with a distribution group. This feature allows detection of "
"distribution group and expands the group so the sharing will be done with"
" the users in the group, instead of using the group as a single user."
msgstr "Med integration af Active Directory ønsker du nogle gange at dele filer og mapper med en distributionsgruppe. Denne funktion gør det muligt at detektere distributionsgruppen og udvide gruppen, så delingen bliver gjort med brugerne i gruppen, i stedet for at bruge gruppen som en enkelt bruger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1436
msgid "**Show user list in sharing dialog**"
msgstr "**Vis brugerliste i delingsdialogen**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1438
msgid ""
"When enabled, the user list will be displayed in the recipient's dropdown"
" list."
msgstr "Når aktiveret, vil brugerlisten blive vist i modtagerens rullemenu."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1441
msgid "**Show guest user list in sharing dialog**"
msgstr "**Vis gæstebrugerliste i delingsdialogen**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1443
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the guest user list will be shown in the "
"recipient dropdown list."
msgstr "Når denne mulighed er aktiveret, vil gæstebrugerlisten blive vist i modtagerens rullemenu."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1446
msgid "**Show group list in sharing dialog**"
msgstr "**Vis gruppeliste i delingsdialogen**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1448
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the group list will be shown in the "
"recipient dropdown list."
msgstr "Når denne indstilling er aktiveret, vil gruppe listen blive vist i modtagerens rulleliste."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1451
msgid "**Allow user enter share name**"
msgstr "**Tillad bruger at indtaste delingsnavn**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1453
msgid ""
"By default the file name or folder name is used for the share name. "
"However, if user has many same name folders or files. Sharing them out "
"sometimes many not know which is which. This setting allows user to "
"change share name. For example, when sharing out a \"Documents\" folder, "
"it can be named \"Documents in top level folder\"."
msgstr "Som standard bruges filnavnet eller mappenavnet til delingsnavnet. Men hvis en bruger har mange mapper eller filer med samme navn, kan det være svært at vide, hvilken der er hvilken, når de deles. Denne indstilling giver brugeren mulighed for at ændre delingsnavnet. For eksempel, når en \"Dokumenter\" mappe deles, kan den navngives \"Dokumenter i øverste niveau mappe\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1455
msgid "**Send a copy of file sharing invitation email to share owner**"
msgstr "**Send en kopi af e-mailinvitationen til fil deling til ejeren af delingen**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1457
msgid ""
"When sending the file-sharing email, sending a copy (CC) to the owner of "
"the share (usually the sender of the email)"
msgstr "Når du sender e-mailen med fildeling, send en kopi (CC) til ejeren af delingen (normalt afsenderen af e-mailen)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1460
msgid "**Don't append email to shared object name under 'Files Shared With Me'**"
msgstr "**Tilføj ikke e-mail til delt objektnavn under 'Filer delt med mig'**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1462
msgid ""
"When enabled, emails won't show next to object names in 'Files Shared "
"With Me' view."
msgstr "Når aktiveret, vil e-mails ikke blive vist ved siden af objektnavne i 'Filer delt med mig'-visningen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1465
msgid "**Disable folder sharing**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver deling af mappe**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1467
msgid "When enabled users will not be able to share folders."
msgstr "Når det er aktiveret, vil brugerne ikke kunne dele mapper."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1470
msgid "**Enforce password protection**"
msgstr "**Håndhæv beskyttelse med adgangskode**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1472
msgid ""
"When enabled all users (including guest users) will be required to use "
"complex password protection."
msgstr "Når det er aktiveret, skal alle brugere (inklusive gæstebrugere) bruge kompleks adgangskodebeskyttelse."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1475
msgid "**Expiration Time for Shared Folder/File (Days):**"
msgstr "**Udløbstid for delt mappe/fil (Dage):**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1477
msgid ""
"When set, during the file/folder sharing wizard, the expiration time "
"dropdown selection will not be shown, it will be pre-set to expiration "
"set in here."
msgstr "Når den er indstillet, vil valget af udløbstid i rullemenuen ikke blive vist under guiden til deling af filer/mapper, det vil være forudindstillet til den udløbstid, der er angivet her."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1480
msgid "**Maximum Share Expiration Time (Days):**"
msgstr "**Maksimal udløbstid for deling (Dage):**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1482
msgid ""
"When set, this creates an upper limit to the time a share will be "
"available, which forces all shares to expire when this limit is reached."
msgstr "Når den er indstillet, skaber dette en øvre grænse for, hvor længe et share vil være tilgængeligt, hvilket tvinger alle shares til at udløbe, når denne grænse er nået."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1484
msgid "**Notify share owner n days before share expiring (0 - do not notify)**"
msgstr "**Underret delingsejeren n dage før deling udløber (0 - underret ikke)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1486
msgid "Notify the sender (owner) of the share before share expiration."
msgstr "Underret afsenderen (ejeren) af delingen før udløb af delingen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1488
msgid "**Expiration Time for public links (Days):**"
msgstr "**Udløbstid for offentlige links (Dage):**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1490
msgid ""
"If left as zero, public link will never expires, otherwise the public "
"link will be purged after expired."
msgstr "Hvis den er sat til nul, udløber offentligt link aldrig, ellers vil det offentlige link blive slettet efter det er udløbet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1493
msgid ""
"**Don't create a guest user account if the recipient is from the "
"following domains (i.e. company.com;company1.com)**"
msgstr "**Opret ikke en gæstebrugerkonto, hvis modtageren er fra følgende domæner (dvs. company.com;company1.com)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1495
msgid ""
"Blacklist guest emails from the domains listed here. Do not allow sharing"
" to these domains."
msgstr "Sortlist gæste-e-mails fra de domæner, der er angivet her. Tillad ikke deling til disse domæner."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1498
msgid "**Only allow sending shares to the specified domain**"
msgstr "**Tillad kun at sende delinger til det angivne domæne**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1500
msgid ""
"You can further limit the sharing to some domain instead of random email."
" For example, if your primary collaboration target is with ACME "
"corporation and you can limit the sharing to your domain and also ACME "
"domain."
msgstr "Du kan yderligere begrænse delingen til et bestemt domæne i stedet for tilfældige e-mails. For eksempel, hvis dit primære samarbejdsmål er med ACME corporation, kan du begrænse delingen til dit eget domæne og også ACMEs domæne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1502
msgid ""
"**Only allow sending shares to the specified domain(s) (i.e. "
"company.com;company1.com)**"
msgstr "**Tillad kun at sende delinger til de angivne domæner (dvs. company.com;company1.com)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1504
msgid ""
"When it is set, the external sharing can only be shared to the white-list"
" of email domains (which represent external partners, clients and etc)"
msgstr "Når den er indstillet, kan ekstern deling kun deles med hvidlistens e-maildomæner (som repræsenterer eksterne partnere, kunder osv.)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1506 ../../chapter03.rst:1713
msgid ""
"**Default folder to store attachments from Outlook plugin "
"(/folder/subfolder)**"
msgstr "**Standardmappe til lagring af vedhæftede filer fra Outlook-plugin (/folder/subfolder)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1508
msgid "Allows you to designate where Outlook attachments are saved."
msgstr "Gør det muligt for dig at bestemme, hvor Outlook-vedhæftede filer gemmes."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1512
msgid "Clients & Applications"
msgstr "Klienter & Applikationer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1515
msgid "Client Settings"
msgstr "Klientindstillinger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1517
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Clients & Applications`` >  "
"``Client Setting``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Klienter & Applikationer`` > ``Klientindstilling``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1523
msgid "CLIENT SETTING MANAGER"
msgstr "KLIENTINDSTILLINGSMANAGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1527
msgid "Sync Throttle"
msgstr "Synkroniseringstakt"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1532
msgid "SYNC THROTTLE SETTINGS"
msgstr "SYNKRONISERING AF INDSTILLINGER FOR BÅNDBREDDEBEGRENSNING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1535
msgid "**Enable Throttle Sync**"
msgstr "**Aktivér Synkronisering med Hastighedsbegrænsning**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1537
msgid ""
"When disabled (default) all Sync Throttle settings in this section are "
"disabled. Must be enabled to activate the following settings."
msgstr "Når deaktiveret (standard) er alle synkroniseringstrottleindstillinger i dette afsnit deaktiveret. Skal aktiveres for at aktivere følgende indstillinger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1539
msgid "**Sync Throttled Upload Bandwidth (KB/s, 0-Unlimited)**"
msgstr "**Synkroniseret begrænset uploadbåndbredde (KB/s, 0-Ubegrænset)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1541
msgid "This setting controls the upload bandwidth from the client machine."
msgstr "Denne indstilling styrer uploadbåndbredden fra klientmaskinen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1543
msgid "**Sync Throttled Download Bandwidth (KB/s, 0-Unlimited)**"
msgstr "**Synkroniseret begrænset download båndbredde (KB/s, 0-Ubegrænset)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1545
msgid "This setting controls the download bandwidth from the client machine."
msgstr "Denne indstilling styrer download båndbredden fra klientmaskinen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1547
msgid "**Full Speed Sync Stop Hour (default 7:00)**"
msgstr "**Fuld hastighed synkronisering stopper klokken (standard 7:00)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1549
msgid ""
"Full speed sync means multiple thread concurrent upload or download. This"
" is typically good for after hour activity. We recommend default setting "
"stop at 7am so when people return to work, the full speed sync stops so "
"to give back more bandwidth to users who may be using the Internet for "
"other purposes."
msgstr "Fuld hastighed synkronisering betyder flere tråde samtidig upload eller download. Dette er typisk godt for aktivitet efter arbejdstid. Vi anbefaler standardindstillingen stopper kl. 7 om morgenen, så når folk vender tilbage til arbejde, stopper den fulde hastighedssynkronisering, så der gives mere båndbredde tilbage til brugere, som måske bruger internettet til andre formål."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1551
msgid "**Full Speed Sync Start Hour (default 20:00)**"
msgstr "**Fuld hastighed synkronisering starttidspunkt (standard 20:00)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1553
msgid ""
"Similar to the above setting, we recommend start full speed sync after "
"working hours."
msgstr "Ligesom med ovenstående indstilling anbefaler vi at starte fuld hastighedssynkronisering efter arbejdstid."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1557
msgid "Scheduled Sync"
msgstr "Planlagt Synkronisering"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1558
msgid "**Enable Scheduled Sync**"
msgstr "**Aktivér planlagt synkronisering**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1560
msgid ""
"On the client side, in addition to a mapped drive (or a mac mounted "
"volume), there is also functionality about folder synchronization. This "
"setting can control when to sync. For example, if the business has "
"limited bandwidth to the Internet, avoid doing synchronization during the"
" working hours can save bandwidth."
msgstr "På klientsiden, ud over et tildelt drev (eller et monteret volumen på en Mac), er der også funktionalitet omkring mappe-synkronisering. Denne indstilling kan styre, hvornår synkronisering skal finde sted. For eksempel, hvis virksomheden har begrænset båndbredde til internettet, kan det at undgå synkronisering i arbejdstimerne spare båndbredde."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1567
msgid "SCHEDULED SYNC SETTINGS"
msgstr "PLANLAGTE SYNKRONISERINGSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1571
msgid "Mapped Drive Control"
msgstr "Mappede Drev Kontrol"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1575
msgid "MAPPED DRIVE CONTROL SETTINGS"
msgstr "KONTROLINDSTILLINGER FOR TILKOBLING AF DREV"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1577
msgid ""
"**Hide Large File Download Tracker (popup progress window on the bottom-"
"right when downloading large files)**"
msgstr "**Skjul sporing af download af store filer (popup-fremdriftsvindue i nederste højre hjørne, når store filer downloades)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1579
msgid ""
"This is usually good for usability but people may find it annoying if "
"download is popping up a download progress dialog at the lower right "
"corner."
msgstr "Dette er normalt godt for brugervenligheden, men folk kan finde det irriterende, hvis download udløser en dialogboks med downloadfremskridt i nederste højre hjørne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1581
msgid "**Always Allow Picture Preview**"
msgstr "**Altid tillad billedvisning**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1583
msgid ""
"Windows Explorer may want to download pictures in the background to "
"generate thumbnails. This consumes bandwidth and may slow system down "
"until all the preview thumbnails are generated. By default the client "
"program disables the preview. However you can re-enable it."
msgstr "Windows Stifinder ønsker måske at downloade billeder i baggrunden for at generere miniaturebilleder. Dette forbruger båndbredde og kan sænke systemet, indtil alle forhåndsvisningerne af miniaturebillederne er genereret. Som standard er forhåndsvisningen deaktiveret i klientprogrammet. Du kan dog genaktivere den."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1585
msgid "**Always Allow PDF Preview**"
msgstr "**Altid tillad PDF-forhåndsvisning**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1587
msgid ""
"Windows Explorer may want to download PDFs in the background to generate "
"thumbnails. This consumes bandwidth and may slow system down until all "
"the preview thumbnails are generated. By default the client program "
"disables the preview. However you can re-enable it."
msgstr "Windows Stifinder ønsker måske at downloade PDF'er i baggrunden for at generere miniaturebilleder. Dette forbruger båndbredde og kan sænke systemet, indtil alle forhåndsvisningens miniaturebilleder er genereret. Som standard deaktiverer klientprogrammet forhåndsvisningen. Du kan dog genaktivere den."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1589
msgid "**Allow shortcuts**"
msgstr "**Tillad genveje**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1591
msgid "Allow shortcuts (.lnk) files"
msgstr "Tillad genveje (.lnk) filer"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1593
msgid "**When starting the client, open the mounted drive automatically**"
msgstr "**Når klienten startes, åbn det monterede drev automatisk**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1595
msgid ""
"Enabling this opens the mounted drive in Windows Explorer when the client"
" starts."
msgstr "Aktivering af dette åbner det monterede drev i Windows Stifinder, når klienten starter."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1597
msgid "**Do not show file change notifications**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke filændringsmeddelelser**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1599
msgid ""
"This is another feature that shows file change notification at the lower "
"right-hand corner of the Windows desktop. People may find it annoying if "
"the change notification comes in quite often."
msgstr "Dette er endnu en funktion, der viser filændringsnotifikationer i nederste højre hjørne af Windows-skrivebordet. Folk kan finde det irriterende, hvis ændringsnotifikationerne kommer for ofte."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1601
msgid "**Do not show file in-place editing/preview disabled notifications**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke meddelelser om deaktivering af redigering/forhåndsvisning af filer på stedet**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1603
msgid ""
"This feature also shows file change notifications at the lower right-hand"
" corner of the Windows desktop. People may find it annoying if the change"
" notification comes in quite often."
msgstr "Denne funktion viser også filændringsnotifikationer i nederste højre hjørne af Windows-skrivebordet. Folk kan finde det irriterende, hvis ændringsnotifikationen kommer ret ofte."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1605
msgid "**Enable Inplace Open Zip File**"
msgstr "**Aktivér Åbning af Zip-fil på stedet**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1607
msgid ""
"Windows Explorer has a zip built-in extension that can open a zip file "
"when double-clicked on. It may be good for the local drive but for cloud "
"drive, that means the zip file is unzipped and re-upload back into the "
"cloud. By default client application disables opening zip files directly "
"in the cloud drive."
msgstr "Windows Stifinder har en indbygget zip-udvidelse, som kan åbne en zip-fil, når der dobbeltklikkes på den. Det kan være godt for det lokale drev, men for cloud-drev betyder det, at zip-filen bliver udpakket og genopladet tilbage i skyen. Som standard deaktiverer klientapplikationen muligheden for at åbne zip-filer direkte på cloud-drevet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1609
msgid "**Enable Single Sign On with login windows user identity**"
msgstr "**Aktivér Single Sign On med login windows brugeridentitet**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1611
msgid ""
"Enable Single Sign-On with Login Windows User Identity - For a Windows "
"client agent running on a Windows Desktop machine, the login windows "
"user's identity will be used for single sign-on to the |prodname| "
"account."
msgstr "Aktivér Single Sign-On med login Windows-brugeridentitet - For en Windows-klientagent, der kører på en Windows Desktop-maskine, vil login Windows-brugerens identitet blive brugt til single sign-on til |prodname|-kontoen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1613
msgid "**Max Size of Zip File Allowed to Open In-place (MB)**"
msgstr "**Maksimal størrelse af zip-fil tilladt at åbne på stedet (MB)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1615
msgid "Limits the size of a Zip File that can be opened in-place."
msgstr "Begrænser størrelsen på en Zip-fil, der kan åbnes på stedet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1617
msgid "**Max Size of File Allowed to Generate Thumbnail (MB)**"
msgstr "**Maksimal filstørrelse tilladt til generering af miniaturebillede (MB)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1619
msgid "Limits the size of Files that can be used in the generation of thumbnails."
msgstr "Begrænser størrelsen på filer, der kan bruges til generering af miniaturer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1621
msgid "**Cloud Drive Label**"
msgstr "**Skydrevsmærkat**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1623
msgid "What do you want to call your windows client drive."
msgstr "Hvad vil du kalde dit Windows-klientdrev."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1625
msgid "**Drive Letter**"
msgstr "**Drevbogstav**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1627
msgid "What do you want to give the drive letter to the client application."
msgstr "Hvilket drevbogstav vil du tildele klientapplikationen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1629
msgid "**Cache Size Limit (MB)**"
msgstr "**Cache Størrelsesgrænse (MB)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1631
msgid ""
"The Windows client maintains a client-side cache of this size (0 - "
"unlimited)"
msgstr "Windows-klienten opretholder en klient-side cache af denne størrelse (0 - ubegrænset)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1633
msgid "**Minimal free disk space (GB)**"
msgstr "**Minimal fri diskplads (GB)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1635
msgid ""
"This setting is used to establish a minimum amount of disk space used for"
" the windows client drive."
msgstr "Denne indstilling bruges til at fastsætte en minimumsmængde diskplads brugt til windows-klientens drev."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1637
msgid "**Purge logging db n days old (0 - don't purge)**"
msgstr "**Slet logningsdatabase n dage gammel (0 - slet ikke)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1639
msgid "This limits how many days of logging are kept in the Windows client cache."
msgstr "Dette begrænser antallet af dage, logningen opbevares i Windows-klientens cache."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1641
msgid "**Mount Drive in global space (Windows Client Only)**"
msgstr "**Monter drev i globalt rum (Kun Windows-klient)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1643
msgid ""
"A drive mounted in the global space will not be subject to UAC (User "
"Account Control) limitations, such as when legacy applications are "
"required to run with administrative privilege and cannot see the drive "
"guarded by the UAC. On the other hand, drives that are mounted in the "
"global space are visible to any other users who log in on the same "
"Windows machine at the same time."
msgstr "Et drev monteret i det globale rum vil ikke være underlagt UAC (User Account Control) begrænsninger, såsom når ældre applikationer kræver at køre med administrativt privilegium og ikke kan se drevet beskyttet af UAC. På den anden side vil drev, der er monteret i det globale rum, være synlige for andre brugere, der logger ind på den samme Windows-maskine på samme tid."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1645
msgid "**In offline mode, only show files that are cached and available locally**"
msgstr "**I offline-tilstand, vis kun filer, der er cachelagret og tilgængelige lokalt**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1647
msgid ""
"Typically there will be place-holder files and representative icons "
"created for all of the files in the client drive. If this setting is "
"enabled, only locally stored files will be shown."
msgstr "Typisk vil der blive oprettet pladsholderfiler og repræsentative ikoner for alle filerne på klientdrevet. Hvis denne indstilling er aktiveret, vil kun lokalt gemte filer blive vist."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1649
msgid "**Disable \"Check Out\"**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver \"Check Out\"**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1651
msgid ""
"Turn off the \"Check Out\" feature and remove it from the right-click "
"context menu."
msgstr "Sluk for funktionen \"Check Out\" og fjern den fra højreklik-kontekstmenuen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1653
msgid "**Encrypt Local Cache**"
msgstr "**Kryptér Lokal Cache**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1655
msgid ""
"Once enabled, when a file is downloaded to cache, it is encrypted in "
"place. When an authorized user then accesses the file from the (M:) "
"Mapped Cloud Drive, CentreStack automatically decrypts it on the fly and "
"then returns it to the user."
msgstr "Når det er aktiveret, bliver en fil, der er downloadet til cachen, krypteret på stedet. Når en autoriseret bruger derefter tilgår filen fra det (M:) Tilsluttede Cloud Drev, dekrypterer CentreStack automatisk filen on the fly og returnerer den derefter til brugeren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1657
msgid "**Disable AutoCad Optimization**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver AutoCad-optimering**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1659
msgid ""
"By default, there is an AutoCAD optimization that delays the "
"synchronization of the updated .dwg file and schedules it to sync upwards"
" to the cloud at a later time. Use this setting to disable this AutoCad "
"optimization and make saving AutoCAD .dwg files act the same as saving "
"other regular files and lets .dwg file behavior follow other policy "
"settings."
msgstr "Som standard er der en AutoCAD-optimering, der forsinket synkroniseringen af den opdaterede .dwg-fil og planlægger den til at synkronisere op til skyen på et senere tidspunkt. Brug denne indstilling til at deaktivere denne AutoCad-optimering og få gemning af AutoCAD .dwg-filer til at fungere på samme måde som gemning af andre almindelige filer og lader .dwg-filens opførsel følge andre politikindstillinger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1663
msgid "Large File Upload"
msgstr "Stor Filoverførsel"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1667
msgid "LARGE FILE UPLOAD SETTINGS"
msgstr "INDSTILLINGER FOR UPLOAD AF STORE FILER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1669
msgid "**Enable chunk uploading when file size larger than (MB)**"
msgstr "**Aktivér opdeling af upload, når filstørrelsen er større end (MB)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1671
msgid ""
"Uploading a single large file can be disrupted by an Internet glitch. "
"This setting breaks large files into smaller chunks to increase the "
"success rate."
msgstr "Upload af en enkelt stor fil kan blive afbrudt af en internetfejl. Denne indstilling opdeler store filer i mindre bidder for at øge succesraten."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1673
msgid "**Chunk file in the unit of (MB)**"
msgstr "**Opdel filen i enheder af (MB)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1675
msgid ""
"Works with the above setting to establish what size the chunks will be in"
" as they are transferred."
msgstr "Fungerer sammen med ovenstående indstilling for at fastlægge størrelsen på de stykker, som de vil blive overført i."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1677
msgid "**Use Volume Shadow Copy to Upload Files being Opened**"
msgstr "**Brug Volumen Skyggekopi til at Uploade Filer, der er Åbne**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1679
msgid ""
"There is pro and con of using this flag. When file is open by other "
"application, the file usually is locked and can't be uploaded until the "
"file is closed. However using volume shadow copy can still upload the "
"file. The down side is when the volume shadow copy happens, the file is "
"not known to be in a consistent state."
msgstr "Der er fordele og ulemper ved at bruge dette flag. Når filen er åben i en anden applikation, er filen normalt låst og kan ikke uploades, før filen er lukket. Dog kan brugen af skyggekopiering stadig uploade filen. Ulempen er, at når skyggekopieringen sker, er det ikke sikkert, at filen er i en konsistent tilstand."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1683
msgid "Bandwidth Control"
msgstr "Båndbreddekontrol"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1687
msgid "BANDWIDTH CONTROL SETTINGS"
msgstr "BÅNDBREDDEKONTROLINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1689
msgid "**Download Bandwidth Limit (KB/s, 0 - Unlimited)**"
msgstr "**Download Båndbreddebegrænsning (KB/s, 0 - Ubegrænset)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1691
msgid "This is download bandwidth control."
msgstr "Dette er kontrol af download båndbredde."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1693
msgid "**Upload Bandwidth Limit (KB/s, 0 - Unlimited)**"
msgstr "**Upload Båndbreddebegrænsning (KB/s, 0 - Ubegrænset)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1695
msgid "This is upload bandwidth control."
msgstr "Dette er kontrol af uploadbåndbredde."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1697
msgid "**Number of File Transfer Threads**"
msgstr "**Antal filoverførselstråde**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1699
msgid "This is the number of concurrent upload/download allowed (default is 5)."
msgstr "Dette er antallet af tilladte samtidige uploads/downloads (standard er 5)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1703
msgid "Outlook Plugin"
msgstr "Outlook-plugin"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1707
msgid "OUTLOOK PLUGIN SETTINGS"
msgstr "OUTLOOK-PLUGININDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1709
msgid "**Prompt conversion only when file is larger than n KB (0 - unlimited)**"
msgstr "**Konverter kun prompt, når filen er større end n KB (0 - ubegrænset)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1711
msgid ""
"For smaller files, it may be as well to just use the native outlook "
"attachment."
msgstr "For mindre filer kan det være lige så godt at bruge det indfødte Outlook-vedhæftning."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1715
msgid "Allows you to set a storage location for the above setting."
msgstr "Giver dig mulighed for at indstille en lagringsplacering for ovenstående indstilling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1717
msgid "**Link expiration time**"
msgstr "**Udløbstid for link**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1719
msgid ""
"Allows Outlook share link to last indefinitely or expire in a specified "
"timeframe (e.g., never, one day, one week, one month, six months, one "
"year)."
msgstr "Gør det muligt for Outlook at dele link, der varer på ubestemt tid, eller udløber i en angivet tidsramme (f.eks. aldrig, en dag, en uge, en måned, seks måneder, et år)."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1723
msgid "Client Startup Script"
msgstr "Klient Opstartsscript"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1724
msgid ""
"After the Windows client is completely started and finished loading, a "
"command line script can be run. You can be upload that script here. For "
"example, a script to map an additional drive letter to a specific folder "
"inside the cloud drive."
msgstr "Når Windows-klienten er fuldstændig startet og færdig med at indlæse, kan et kommandolinjescript køres. Du kan uploade det script her. For eksempel et script til at kortlægge et ekstra drevbogstav til en specifik mappe inde i skydrevet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1728
msgid "Client Shutdown Script"
msgstr "Klient Luk Ned Script"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1729
msgid ""
"Right before the Windows client is completely shutdown and finished "
"running, a command line script can be run. You can upload that script "
"here. For example, a script to clean up any reference to folders and "
"files inside the cloud drive."
msgstr "Lige før Windows-klienten er helt lukket ned og færdig med at køre, kan et kommandolinjescript køres. Du kan uploade det script her. For eksempel et script til at rydde op i eventuelle referencer til mapper og filer inde på cloud-drevet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1733
msgid "Mac Client Settings"
msgstr "Mac-klientindstillinger"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1734
msgid "**Do not show Mac Client sync status pop up dialog**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke pop op-dialogboksen for synkroniseringsstatus for Mac-klient**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1736
msgid ""
"This is usually good for usability but people may find it annoying if the"
" file status is popping up a progress dialog at the lower right corner."
msgstr "Dette er som regel godt for brugervenligheden, men folk kan finde det irriterende, hvis filstatus viser en fremdriftsdialog i nederste højre hjørne."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1739
msgid "**Start Mac Client automatically**"
msgstr "**Start Mac-klienten automatisk**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1741
msgid ""
"(Enabled by default.) If this is disabled, the Mac Client must be started"
" manually."
msgstr "(Aktiveret som standard.) Hvis dette er deaktiveret, skal Mac-klienten startes manuelt."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1745
msgid "Web Portal"
msgstr "Webportal"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1747
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` >  ``Clients & Applications`` > ``Web "
"Portal``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Klienter & Applikationer`` > ``Webportal``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1752
msgid "WEB PORTAL SETTINGS"
msgstr "WEBPORTAL INDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1755
msgid "**Disable folder download from web client**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver mappe download fra webklient**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1757
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. The folder download from web client will zip up the "
"folder and download it. It is CPU intensive so if you don't want it to be"
" consuming too much CPU, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Som standard deaktiveret. Når man downloader en mappe fra webklienten, vil mappen blive zippet og downloadet. Det er CPU-krævende, så hvis du ikke ønsker, at det skal forbruge for meget CPU, kan du deaktivere det ved hjælp af denne indstilling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1759
msgid "**Disable Search**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver søgning**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1761
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. If you don't need the search by file name feature, "
"you can check this setting to disable it."
msgstr "Deaktiveret som standard. Hvis du ikke har brug for funktionen til søgning efter filnavn, kan du markere denne indstilling for at deaktivere den."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1763
msgid "**Web Browser - Disable Java Uploader**"
msgstr "**Webbrowser - Deaktiver Java-uploader**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1765
msgid ""
"Some organization standardized on web browser, for example, all web "
"browser are HTML5 compliant. In this case, Java Uploader is not necessary"
" and could be confusing to support when different users have different "
"Java version installed."
msgstr "Nogle organisationer har standardiseret på webbrowsere, for eksempel er alle webbrowsere HTML5-kompatible. I dette tilfælde er Java Uploader ikke nødvendig og kan være forvirrende at supportere, når forskellige brugere har forskellige versioner af Java installeret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1767
msgid "**Web Browser - Disable Flash Uploader**"
msgstr "**Webbrowser - Deaktiver Flash-uploader**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1769
msgid ""
"Some organization standardized on web browser, for example, all web "
"browser are HTML5 compliant. In this case, Flash Uploader is not "
"necessary and could be confusing to support when different users have "
"different Flash version installed. Different kind of web browser may also"
" have different levels of Flash support, causing different behavior."
msgstr "Nogle organisationer standardiserer på webbrowser, for eksempel er alle webbrowsere HTML5-kompatible. I dette tilfælde er Flash Uploader ikke nødvendig og kan være forvirrende at understøtte, når forskellige brugere har forskellige versioner af Flash installeret. Forskellige typer af webbrowsere kan også have forskellige niveauer af Flash-understøttelse, hvilket forårsager forskellig adfærd."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1771
msgid "**Web Browser - Disable Local Uploader**"
msgstr "**Webbrowser - Deaktiver lokal uploader**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1773
msgid ""
"Admin can also disable local uploaded in which case the upload will "
"happen using the browser directly."
msgstr "Admin kan også deaktivere lokal upload, i hvilket tilfælde upload vil ske direkte via browseren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1775
msgid "**Enable Tabbed-Browsing in User Manager**"
msgstr "**Aktivér Tabbed-Browsing i Brugerstyring**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1777
msgid ""
"When enabled, the user manager will order users by their last name so if "
"you have many users, you have an easy to access way to find the users."
msgstr "Når det er aktiveret, vil brugeradministratoren sortere brugere efter deres efternavn, så hvis du har mange brugere, har du en nem måde at finde brugerne på."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1779
msgid "**Only show search interface in User Manager**"
msgstr "**Vis kun søgegrænsefladen i Brugerstyring**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1781
msgid ""
"When you have even more users, Tabbed-Browsing can't handle it any more, "
"you can enable search-only interface."
msgstr "Når du har endnu flere brugere, kan Tabbed-Browsing ikke håndtere det længere, du kan aktivere søgekun-grænsefladen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1783
msgid "**Show tutorial page for non-admin users**"
msgstr "**Vis vejledningsside for ikke-administratorbrugere**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1785
msgid "Display tutorial page for regular users when they login to the web portal."
msgstr "Vis vejledningssiden for almindelige brugere, når de logger ind på webportalen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1787
msgid "**Show team folder level permissions in team folder publishing dialog**"
msgstr "**Vis teammappeniveau tilladelser i dialogboksen til publicering af teammappe**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1789
msgid ""
"The advanced setting refers to “Create CIFS Share”, “Disable further "
"sharing”, and “Disable Offline Access” settings."
msgstr "Den avancerede indstilling henviser til \"Opret CIFS Share\", \"Deaktiver yderligere deling\" og \"Deaktiver Offline Adgang\" indstillinger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1791
msgid "**Disable 'Publish Tenant Home Storage As a Team Folder'**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver 'Udgiv Tenant Home Storage som en Team Mappe'**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1793
msgid ""
"This feature can be hidden in Tenant Management Console > Team Folder > "
"Add New Team Folder"
msgstr "Denne funktion kan skjules i Tenant Management Console > Team Folder > Tilføj ny teammappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1795
msgid "**Confirm before moving via drag-and-drop**"
msgstr "**Bekræft før flytning via træk-og-slip**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1797
msgid ""
"In web portal, sometimes there can be accidental drag and drop, in this "
"case, having a confirmation dialog can help prevent accidental drag and "
"drop."
msgstr "I webportalen kan der undertiden ske utilsigtet træk og slip, og i dette tilfælde kan en bekræftelsesdialog hjælpe med at forhindre utilsigtet træk og slip."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1799
msgid "**Show left tree view by default**"
msgstr "**Vis venstre trævisning som standard**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1801
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled left-tree is displayed when you log in "
"to the web portal."
msgstr "Deaktiveret som standard. Når det er aktiveret, vises venstre træ, når du logger ind på webportalen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1803
msgid "**Do not show \"recent activities**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke \"seneste aktiviteter**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1805
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled \"recent activities\" is not visible in"
" the Show/Hide Info Panel on the right side of the Web Portal File "
"Browser."
msgstr "Som standard deaktiveret. Når det er aktiveret, er \"seneste aktiviteter\" ikke synlige i Vis/Skjul Info Panelet på højre side af Web Portal Filbrowseren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1807
msgid "**Show 'link to local' option to non-admin user**"
msgstr "**Vis 'link til lokal' mulighed for ikke-administratorbruger**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1809
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, non-admin user will have access to the"
" **\"Link to Local\"** option in the Sharing and Collaboration tab under "
"the Show/Hide Info Panel on the right side of the Web Portal File "
"Browser."
msgstr "Som standard deaktiveret. Når aktiveret, vil ikke-administratorbrugere have adgang til **\"Link til Lokal\"**-muligheden i fanen Deling og Samarbejde under Vis/Skjul Info Panel på højre side af Web Portal Filbrowseren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1811
msgid "**Show max count of file/folder items**"
msgstr "**Vis maksimalt antal af fil-/mappeelementer**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1813
msgid ""
"Default files to show is 1,000. Some customers may have a very flat "
"folder that has more than one thousand files. It is not recommended to "
"have a cloud system have flat folder structure like this. But if customer"
" has many files in a flat folder. This setting can be used to show all "
"files by increasing this number as needed."
msgstr "Standardfilerne, der skal vises, er 1.000. Nogle kunder kan have en meget flad mappe, der har mere end tusind filer. Det anbefales ikke at have et cloudsystem med en sådan flad mappestruktur. Men hvis kunden har mange filer i en flad mappe, kan denne indstilling bruges til at vise alle filer ved at øge dette tal efter behov."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1817
msgid "Native Client"
msgstr "Nativ klient"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1819
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` >  ``Clients & Applications`` > "
"``Native Client``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Klienter & Applikationer`` > ``Nativ Klient``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1824
msgid "NATIVE CLIENT SETTINGS"
msgstr "INDFØDTE KLIENTINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1826
msgid "**Create a shortcut in the documents library**"
msgstr "**Opret en genvej i dokumentbiblioteket**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1828
msgid ""
"Enabled by default. This is a convenience feature to add a link to "
"documents library to the cloud drive."
msgstr "Aktiveret som standard. Dette er en bekvemmelighedsfunktion for at tilføje et link til dokumentbiblioteket til cloud-drevet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1830
msgid "**Create shortcut on desktop**"
msgstr "**Opret genvej på skrivebordet**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1832
msgid "Enabled by default. Same as above but the shortcut is on the desktop."
msgstr "Aktiveret som standard. Samme som ovenfor, men genvejen er på skrivebordet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1834
msgid "**Hide Settings in Windows Client Management Console**"
msgstr "**Skjul indstillinger i Windows-klientens administrationskonsol**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1836
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. The Settings in the Windows client may be viewed as "
"“too much information for normal user”. If that is the case, enabling "
"this option will hide those settings."
msgstr "Deaktiveret som standard. Indstillingerne i Windows-klienten kan opfattes som 'for meget information for den normale bruger'. Hvis det er tilfældet, vil aktivering af denne mulighed skjule disse indstillinger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1838
msgid "**Don't Allow Setting Changes in Windows Client Management Console**"
msgstr "**Tillad ikke ændringer af indstillinger i Windows Client Management Console**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1840
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. When disabled the Windows Client user can change the"
" settings in the Windows Client Management Console."
msgstr "Som standard deaktiveret. Når det er deaktiveret, kan Windows-klientbrugeren ændre indstillingerne i Windows-klientens administrationskonsol."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1842
msgid "**Disable Windows client in-place drag & drop uploading**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver træk & slip-upload direkte på Windows-klienten**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1844
msgid ""
"Unchecked by default. When enabled, dragging & dropping files (or "
"folders) to the cloud drive will write files to the local cache first and"
" then upload in the background."
msgstr "Som standard ikke markeret. Når den er aktiveret, vil træk & slip af filer (eller mapper) til cloud-drevet først skrive filer til den lokale cache og derefter uploade i baggrunden."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1846
msgid "**Disable Auto-Login next time**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver automatisk login næste gang**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1848
msgid ""
"Unchecked by default. When you want the user to type in username/password"
" every time they login to the Windows client, you can check this to "
"disable auto-login."
msgstr "Som standard ikke markeret. Når du ønsker, at brugeren skal indtaste brugernavn/adgangskode hver gang de logger ind på Windows-klienten, kan du markere dette for at deaktivere automatisk login."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1850
msgid "**Disable drag & drop handler**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver træk & slip-håndtering**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1852
msgid ""
"Unchecked by default. If you check this option, the Windows file drag and"
" drop will take over, this typically means the files will be copied into "
"cache before upload, thus resulting in two copies of files being "
"uploaded."
msgstr "Som standard ikke markeret. Hvis du markerer dette valg, vil Windows filtræk og slip tage over, dette betyder typisk, at filerne vil blive kopieret til cachen før upload, hvilket resulterer i, at to kopier af filerne bliver uploadet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1854
msgid "**Requiring approval for device access**"
msgstr "**Kræver godkendelse for enhedsadgang**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1856
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. When a user attempts to log in from a new device via"
" native client applications, the connection will be rejected until the "
"tenant admin approves the new device. The approval can be done from the "
"\"Client Device Manager\""
msgstr "Som standard deaktiveret. Når en bruger forsøger at logge ind fra en ny enhed via native klientapplikationer, vil forbindelsen blive afvist, indtil lejeradministratoren godkender den nye enhed. Godkendelsen kan foretages fra \"Klientenhedsadministratoren\""

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1858
msgid "**Enable auto-install of Outlook Plugin**"
msgstr "**Aktivér automatisk installation af Outlook-plugin**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1860
msgid ""
"Disabled by default. The Cluster Server Windows Desktop client comes with"
" an Outlook plug-in. If this option is enabled, the Outlook plugin will "
"be enabled upon client startup."
msgstr "Deaktiveret som standard. Cluster Server Windows Desktop-klienten leveres med et Outlook-plug-in. Hvis denne mulighed er aktiveret, vil Outlook-plugin'en være aktiveret ved klientopstart."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1862
msgid "**Disable native client for guest users**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver indbygget klient for gæstebrugere**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1864
msgid ""
"Unchecked by default. For guest users, don't allow them to use native "
"client, so the guest users can only use web browser files and folder "
"view."
msgstr "Som standard ikke markeret. For gæstebrugere, tillad dem ikke at bruge den native klient, så gæstebrugere kun kan bruge webbrowserens filer og mappevisning."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1869
msgid "Folder & Storage"
msgstr "Mappe & Opbevaring"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1872
msgid "Backend Storage"
msgstr "Backend-lagring"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1874
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` >  ``Folder & Storage`` > ``Backend "
"Storage``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Mappe & Lager`` > ``Backend Storage``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1876
msgid ""
"Each tenant has a default backend storage. Tenant user (team user)'s home"
" storage and other shared storage space can be allocated from the default"
" backend storage."
msgstr "Hver lejer har et standard backend-lager. Lejerbruger (teambruger)s hjemmelager og andet delt lagerplads kan allokeres fra standard backend-lageret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1881
msgid ""
"You can think of the Tenant Backend Storage as a \"Black Box\" managed by"
" the Cluster Server and you shall always use the Cluster Server interface"
" to interact with the content inside the storage. If you can't take this "
"\"Black Box\" approach for the tenant's root backend storage, you can use"
" the following other methods via the team folders, such as import file "
"server network share."
msgstr "Du kan tænke på Tenant Backend Storage som en \"Sort Boks\", der styres af Cluster Serveren, og du skal altid bruge Cluster Serverens interface til at interagere med indholdet inde i lageret. Hvis du ikke kan tage denne \"Sort Boks\" tilgang til tenantens rod backend lager, kan du bruge følgende andre metoder via teammapperne, såsom at importere filserver netværksdeling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1883
msgid ""
"However, if you already have a file server that will provide the storage,"
" it is recommended to use \"Import Network File Shares\" to mount the "
"file server network share to the tenant's storage space. In this case, "
"you can leave the \"Default Storage\" as is, or point it to an empty "
"location and treat it as a black box storage managed at the Cluster "
"Server level."
msgstr "Hvis du allerede har en filserver, der vil levere lageret, anbefales det at bruge \"Importér Netværksfilandele\" til at montere filserverens netværksandel til lejerens lagringsplads. I dette tilfælde kan du lade \"Standard Lager\" være som det er, eller pege det på en tom placering og behandle det som en sort boks-lager, der administreres på Cluster Server-niveau."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1888
msgid "STORAGE MANAGER ACCESS"
msgstr "LAGERSTYRINGSADGANG"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1890
msgid ""
"To access the Tenant Storage Manager, click \"Folder & Storage\" on "
"\"Settings\" section. To check the backend storage information, click the"
" dropdown at the top right corner, and select \"Edit\", to edit the "
"storage configuration details."
msgstr "For at få adgang til Tenant Storage Manager, klik på \"Mappe & Lager\" i \"Indstillinger\"-sektionen. For at tjekke baggrundsoplagringsinformationen, klik på rullemenuen øverst til højre og vælg \"Rediger\", for at redigere oplysningsdetaljerne for lagerkonfigurationen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1892
msgid ""
"If cluster admin needs to check the backend storage for multiple tenants,"
" go to \"Tenant Manager\". Click the \"hamburger\" menu at the top right "
"corner of each tenant, and then choose \"Edit Existing Default Storage\"."
msgstr "Hvis en klyngeadministrator skal kontrollere backend-lagringen for flere lejere, skal du gå til \"Lejeradministrator\". Klik på \"hamburger\"-menuen øverst i højre hjørne af hver lejer og vælg derefter \"Rediger eksisterende standardlagring\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1897
msgid "STORAGE MANAGER ACCESS - MULTIPLE TENANTS"
msgstr "LAGERSTYRINGSADGANG - FLERE LEJERE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1902
msgid ""
"You can mount different storage services into a single namespace (folder "
"structure). For example, if you have multiple Amazon S3 buckets, you can "
"mount them all in. If you have multiple OpenStack Swift accounts, you can"
" mount them all in as well. If you have multiple file server network "
"shares, you can add them to the storage manager."
msgstr "Du kan montere forskellige lagringstjenester i et enkelt navneområde (mappestruktur). For eksempel, hvis du har flere Amazon S3-buckets, kan du montere dem alle sammen. Hvis du har flere OpenStack Swift-konti, kan du også montere dem alle sammen. Hvis du har flere netværksandele på filservere, kan du tilføje dem til lagringsmanageren."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1906
msgid ""
"The cluster manager can define whether or not the Storage Manager is "
"exposed to the tenant administrator."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan definere, om Storage Manager er tilgængelig for lejeradministratoren eller ej."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1911
msgid "EDITING STORAGE SETTINGS"
msgstr "REDIGERING AF LAGRINGSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1914
msgid "Edit Local Storage"
msgstr "Rediger Lokal Lager"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1916
msgid ""
"This is the file server UNC path or local windows folder path that you "
"will connect into the tenant administrator's root folder structure. The "
"idea here is you will take this folder and mount the folder to the tenant"
" administrator's root folder structure."
msgstr "Dette er UNC-stien til filserveren eller den lokale Windows-mappesti, som du vil forbinde til tenant-administratorens rodmappestruktur. Tanken her er, at du vil tage denne mappe og montere mappen til tenant-administratorens rodmappestruktur."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1921
msgid ""
"The user name is the Windows username, either it being local Windows user"
" or global Active Directory user, this is a Windows account that is "
"capable of accessing the \"Local Storage Location\"."
msgstr "Brugernavnet er Windows-brugernavnet, uanset om det er en lokal Windows-bruger eller en global Active Directory-bruger, dette er en Windows-konto, der er i stand til at få adgang til \"Lokal lagringsplacering\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1926
msgid "This is the password for the Windows user above."
msgstr "Dette er adgangskoden til Windows-brugeren ovenfor."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1930
msgid ""
"We recommend this Windows user and his credential be set up as a service "
"account, meaning the password isn't subject to the maximum password days "
"via local security policy. The reason being, that, when it is time to "
"rotate or change the user password, the connection here may be broken "
"until the password is updated to match."
msgstr "Vi anbefaler, at denne Windows-bruger og hans legitimationsoplysninger opsættes som en tjenestekonto, hvilket betyder, at adgangskoden ikke er underlagt den maksimale adgangskodedage via lokal sikkerhedspolitik. Årsagen er, at når det er tid til at rotere eller ændre brugeradgangskoden, kan forbindelsen her være afbrudt, indtil adgangskoden er opdateret, så den stemmer overens."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1933
msgid "**“Always access the storage using logon user identity”**"
msgstr "**\"Altid adgang til lagringen ved hjælp af logon brugeridentitet\"**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1935
msgid ""
"When you have Active Directory Integration, and mount an existing file "
"server network share in, you can select “Always access the storage using "
"logon user identity” so the ACL (NTFS Permission) on the file server "
"share will be used natively. The access permission will be checked "
"natively against the user's Active Directory identity that is defined by "
"the NTFS permission."
msgstr "Når du har integration med Active Directory og monterer et eksisterende netværksdrev fra en filserver, kan du vælge \"Altid adgang til lagringen ved hjælp af brugerens logonidentitet\", så ACL (NTFS-tilladelse) på filserverens drev vil blive brugt nativt. Adgangstilladelsen vil blive kontrolleret nativt mod brugerens Active Directory-identitet, som er defineret af NTFS-tilladelsen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1937
msgid ""
"This option only applies to the \"Local Storage\" such as network share, "
"DFS share, local folder, and etc."
msgstr "Denne indstilling gælder kun for \"Lokal lagring\" såsom netværksdeling, DFS-deling, lokal mappe og lignende."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1939
msgid "**“The share is from a Linux/Unix/ZFS server”**"
msgstr "**“Aktien er fra en Linux/Unix/ZFS-server”**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1941
msgid ""
"Most of the time, you don't want to check this flag because your file "
"server share shall behave like a normal Windows Server share, even if it "
"doesn't come from a Windows Server."
msgstr "Det meste af tiden vil du ikke markere dette flag, fordi dit filserver-share skal opføre sig som et normalt Windows Server-share, selvom det ikke kommer fra en Windows Server."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1943
msgid ""
"In some small SOHO network storage devices, it may only allow one "
"connection from one IP address, so if that is the case, you want to check"
" this flag. Most of the time, you just don't need to check this when the "
"network share is capable of taking multiple connections/sessions from one"
" single machine."
msgstr "I nogle små SOHO-netværkslagringsenheder kan det være, at de kun tillader én forbindelse fra én IP-adresse, så hvis det er tilfældet, vil du tjekke dette flag. Det meste af tiden behøver du bare ikke at tjekke dette, når netværksdrevet er i stand til at tage flere forbindelser/sessioner fra én enkelt maskine."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1945
msgid "**“This share is a DFS share”**"
msgstr "**“Denne fællesmappe er en DFS-fællesmappe”**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1947
msgid ""
"If the share is a DFS share, you will check this checkbox, because DFS "
"share has an extra layer of translation to translate back down to normal "
"file server shares. This flag tells the Cluster Server to do an extra DFS"
" translation back to SMB share before connecting to the share."
msgstr "Hvis delingen er en DFS-deling, vil du markere denne afkrydsningsboks, fordi DFS-deling har et ekstra lag af oversættelse for at oversætte tilbage til normale filserverdelinger. Dette flag fortæller Cluster Serveren at foretage en ekstra DFS-oversættelse tilbage til SMB-deling, før den forbinder til delingen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1949
msgid "**“Enable Inplace Versioning”**"
msgstr "**“Aktivér versionsstyring på stedet”**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1951
msgid ""
"The underlying file server network share may not have explicit version "
"control (it may have volume shadow copy for other purposes). This will "
"add Cluster Server version control to the file server network share. It "
"is independent of and not related to the volume shadow copy."
msgstr "Den underliggende filserver-netværksdeling har måske ikke eksplicit versionskontrol (den kan have skyggekopiering af disken til andre formål). Dette vil tilføje klynge server versionskontrol til filserver-netværksdelingen. Det er uafhængigt af og ikke relateret til skyggekopiering af disken."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1955
msgid ""
"In place versioning will put the older version of the file into a __ver__"
" subfolder in the same folder structure making the name for In-Place "
"Versioning so the folder structure is maintained as-is, while extra old "
"copies of the file will be stored in a specific subfolder."
msgstr "In place-versionering vil placere den ældre version af filen i en __ver__ undermappe i den samme mappestruktur, hvilket gør navnet på In-Place Versionering således at mappestrukturen opretholdes som den er, mens ekstra gamle kopier af filen vil blive opbevaret i en specifik undermappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1960
msgid "IN-PLACE VERSIONING"
msgstr "IN-PLACE VERSIONERING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1962
msgid ""
"Here is a demo video showing the result of \"Enable Inplace Versioning\" "
"when the root folder ('forward slash') is mounted with the \"Inplace "
"versioning\" enabled."
msgstr "Her er en demovideo, der viser resultatet af \"Aktiver Inplace-versionering\", når rodmappen ('skråstreg') er monteret med \"Inplace-versionering\" aktiveret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1971
msgid "Migrate to New Storage"
msgstr "Migrer til ny lagring"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1976
msgid "CLOUD STORAGE MIGRATE"
msgstr "SKYLAGRING MIGRERE"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1978
msgid ""
"Once the tenant backend storage is set, we don't recommend changing it "
"until it has to be changed (e.g., migrate to other location). However "
"when you are just setting up the tenant, you can decide where your "
"tenant's storage location is and can change between local file server "
"storage or remote cloud storage service."
msgstr "Når lejerens backend-lagring er indstillet, anbefaler vi ikke at ændre den, før det er nødvendigt (f.eks. ved migration til en anden placering). Men når du lige er ved at opsætte lejeren, kan du bestemme, hvor lejerens lagringsplacering er, og kan skifte mellem lokal filserverlagring eller fjern cloudlagringstjeneste."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1980
msgid "There are two types of storage migrations."
msgstr "Der findes to typer af lagringsmigrationer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1986
msgid "**1.** Migrate data to a different location in the same type of storage:"
msgstr "**1.** Migrer data til en anden placering i samme type lager:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1983
msgid "Identify the location of the current storage"
msgstr "Identificer placeringen af den aktuelle lagring"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1984
msgid ""
"Copy the content to the new location (for example, you can use xcopy *.* "
"from the old location to the new location"
msgstr "Kopier indholdet til den nye placering (for eksempel kan du bruge xcopy *.* fra den gamle placering til den nye placering"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1985
msgid "Login to web portal as Cluster Admin."
msgstr "Log ind på webportalen som Cluster Admin."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1986
msgid ""
"Go to Tenant Manager -> Manage the specific Tenant -> Backend Storage and"
" click on edit to point to the new location"
msgstr "Gå til Tenant Manager -> Administrer den specifikke Tenant -> Backend Storage og klik på rediger for at pege på den nye placering"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1991
msgid "**2.**  Migrate data to a different type of storage:"
msgstr "**2.**  Migrer data til en anden type lager:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1989
msgid "Go to the registry using regedit"
msgstr "Gå til registreringsdatabasen ved hjælp af regedit"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1990
msgid ""
"Go to HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Gladinet\\\\Enterprise\\\\ and add a new string"
" value called 'CanChangeDefaultStorage' and set the value to 'True' and "
"reboot"
msgstr "Gå til HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Gladinet\\Enterprise\\ og tilføj en ny strengværdi kaldet 'CanChangeDefaultStorage' og sæt værdien til 'True' og genstart"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1991
msgid ""
"Edit the storage type using new icon to edit storage under Cluster "
"Manager\\Tenant Manager"
msgstr "Rediger lagringstypen ved at bruge nyt ikon til at redigere lagring under Cluster Manager\Tenant Manager"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1995
msgid ""
"It is not recommended that you modify registry settings. Create a backup "
"of the registry before modifying any registry settings."
msgstr "Det anbefales ikke, at du ændrer registreringsdatabaseindstillinger. Opret en sikkerhedskopi af registreringsdatabasen, før du ændrer nogen registreringsdatabaseindstillinger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:1998
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Bevaringspolitik"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2000
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Folder & Storage`` > ``Retention "
"Policy``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Mappe & Lager`` > ``Bevaringspolitik``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2006
msgid "RETENTION POLICY SETTINGS"
msgstr "RETENTIONSPOLITIKINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2008
msgid ""
"The cloud monitoring service on the Cluster Server will be responsible "
"for the retention policy. The settings of the retention policy are "
"described below."
msgstr "Cloudovervågningstjenesten på klynge-serveren vil være ansvarlig for bevarelsespolitikken. Indstillingerne for bevarelsespolitikken er beskrevet nedenfor."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2010
msgid "**Keep last n version(s) of files in versioned folder**"
msgstr "**Bevar de sidste n version(er) af filer i versionsmappen**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2012
msgid ""
"This setting lets you decide how many versions of files to keep in the "
"version folder. (0 - let system decide, also apply to \"attached local "
"folder')"
msgstr "Denne indstilling lader dig bestemme, hvor mange versioner af filer der skal gemmes i versionsmappen. (0 - lad systemet bestemme, gælder også for \"tilknyttet lokal mappe\")"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2014
msgid "**Only purge versioned files that are more than n day(s) old**"
msgstr "**Kun slet versionerede filer, der er mere end n dag(e) gamle**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2016
msgid ""
"This is a security feature. For example, there is a virus modified the "
"same file many times so it created many versions causing good old "
"versions to be scheduled for deletion. However, with this set, the good "
"old versions will be kept for at least the amount of days so give enough "
"time to recover. (0 - purge old versions once they exceed the version "
"limit, regardless of the version lifespan)"
msgstr "Dette er en sikkerhedsfunktion. For eksempel, hvis der er en virus der har ændret den samme fil mange gange, så det har skabt mange versioner og forårsaget at gode gamle versioner er planlagt til sletning. Men med dette sæt, vil de gode gamle versioner blive bevaret i mindst antallet af dage, så der er nok tid til at gendanne. (0 - slet gamle versioner når de overskrider versionsgrænsen, uanset versionens levetid)"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2018
msgid "**Keep deleted files in versioned folder and/or Trash Can for n day(s)**"
msgstr "**Bevar slettede filer i versionsmappe og/eller Papirkurv i n dag(e)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2020
msgid ""
"When a file is deleted in the version folder, it is not actually deleted."
" It will be kept for several days defined here. The same policy also "
"apply to"
msgstr "Når en fil slettes i versionsmappen, bliver den ikke faktisk slettet. Den vil blive bevaret i flere dage defineret her. Den samme politik gælder også for"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2022
msgid "**Keep file change log for n day(s)**"
msgstr "**Bevar filændringslog i n dag(e)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2024
msgid ""
"File change log is the biggest database table and could be growing "
"without trimming. You can decide how often you want to trim the table."
msgstr "Filændringsloggen er den største databasetabel og kan vokse uden beskæring. Du kan bestemme, hvor ofte du ønsker at beskære tabellen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2028
msgid ""
"There is also a cluster setting about the file change log length. The "
"cluster setting overrides the per-tenant setting."
msgstr "Der er også en klyngeindstilling om længden på filændringsloggen. Klyngeindstillingen tilsidesætter den pr. lejer-indstilling."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2030
msgid "**Keep audit trace for n day(s)**"
msgstr "**Bevar revisionslog for n dag(e)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2032
msgid ""
"Audit trace log is stored in a local device directory and keeps a record "
"of high-level activity from a device (e.g., windows client, server "
"agent). This setting limits the number of days that are stored in the "
"local database file."
msgstr "Revisionsloggen gemmes i en lokal enhedsmappe og fører optegnelser over aktiviteter på højt niveau fra en enhed (f.eks. Windows-klient, serveragent). Denne indstilling begrænser antallet af dage, der gemmes i den lokale databasefil."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2034
msgid ""
"**Hide purge option from web file browser (not applicable to tenant "
"administrator)**"
msgstr "**Skjul muligheden for at rense fra webfilbrowseren (gælder ikke for tenantadministrator)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2036
msgid "Do not show the purge window to users when deleting content."
msgstr "Vis ikke slettevinduet for brugerne, når indhold slettes."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2038
msgid "**Don't send email notifications when purging deleted content**"
msgstr "**Send ikke e-mail notifikationer, når slettet indhold ryddes**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2040
msgid ""
"There are times when an admin would not want to send or see delete email "
"notifications for purged contents."
msgstr "Der er tidspunkter, hvor en administrator ikke ønsker at sende eller se e-mail notifikationer for slettede indhold."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2042
msgid "**Include deleted but not yet purged items in storage quota**"
msgstr "**Inkluder slettede, men endnu ikke endeligt fjernede elementer i lagerkvoten**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2044
msgid ""
"Allows you to decide if you want to include not visible (purged) files in"
" the storage quota that is used."
msgstr "Giver dig mulighed for at bestemme, om du vil inkludere ikke synlige (slettede) filer i den anvendte lagerkvote."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2047
msgid "Folder and Storage"
msgstr "Mappe og Lager"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2049
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Folder & Storage`` > ``Folder and "
"Storage``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Mappe & Lager`` > ``Mappe og Lager``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2051
msgid ""
"These are the settings available to the tenant manager in the Folder and "
"Storage view."
msgstr "Dette er de indstillinger, der er tilgængelige for lejeradministratoren i visningen af Mapper og Lager."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2056
msgid "FOLDER AND STORAGE SETTINGS"
msgstr "MAPPE- OG LAGRINGSINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2059
msgid "**Allow users to attach external cloud storage**"
msgstr "**Tillad brugere at tilknytte ekstern cloudlagring**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2061
msgid ""
"When checked, you will allow users to see storage manager and allow them "
"to attach external storage such as their own Amazon S3 bucket into the "
"system."
msgstr "Når dette er markeret, vil du tillade brugere at se lagerstyring og tillade dem at tilknytte ekstern lagerplads såsom deres egen Amazon S3-spand til systemet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2064
msgid "**Disable Versioned folder**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver versionsmappe**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2066
msgid ""
"Normally you will NOT disable versioned folder. Because versioned folder "
"is the supporting feature for “Two-way sync locally attached folder”. If "
"you disable versioned folder, you will lose the two-way synchronization "
"folder feature as well."
msgstr "Normalt vil du IKKE deaktivere versionsmappen. Fordi versionsmappen er en understøttende funktion for \"Tovejs synkronisering af lokalt tilsluttet mappe\". Hvis du deaktiverer versionsmappen, vil du også miste funktionen til tovejs synkroniseringsmappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2070
msgid "**Disable Trash Can**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver Papirkurv**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2072
msgid ""
"For folders that are not under version control, a deleted file will be "
"moved into Trash Can. If this feature is not useful, you can disable it."
msgstr "For mapper, der ikke er under versionskontrol, vil en slettet fil blive flyttet til Papirkurven. Hvis denne funktion ikke er nyttig, kan du deaktivere den."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2076
msgid "**Don't show folder that user doesn't have read permission**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke mapper, som brugeren ikke har læserettigheder til**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2078
msgid ""
"With native Active Directory integration and with network share as "
"backend storage, the user's permission to the folders are checked "
"natively. When this option is set, for those folders that users doesn't "
"have read permission, the folder will be hidden."
msgstr "Med indbygget integration af Active Directory og med netværksdeling som backend-lagring, kontrolleres brugerens tilladelser til mapperne nativt. Når denne indstilling er sat, vil de mapper, som brugerne ikke har læsetilladelse til, blive skjult."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2082
msgid ""
"**Don't show team folder that the user doesn't have read permission to "
"the underlying folder**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke teammappen, som brugeren ikke har læseadgang til den underliggende mappe**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2084
msgid ""
"In the folder listing, if the user don't have read permission, sometimes "
"it is better off not to show the folder to the user."
msgstr "I mappeoversigten er det nogle gange bedre ikke at vise mappen for brugeren, hvis brugeren ikke har læsetilladelse."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2087
msgid "**Don't show Trash Can for non-admin user**"
msgstr "**Vis ikke skraldespand for ikke-administratorbruger**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2089
msgid ""
"Trash Can is a virtual folder that shows up at the web browser portal "
"only. This setting controls whether or not to show it for regular team "
"user."
msgstr "Papirkurven er en virtuel mappe, der kun vises i webbrowserportalen. Denne indstilling styrer, om den skal vises for almindelige teambrugere eller ej."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2093
msgid "**Don't append (Team Folder) to published folders**"
msgstr "**Tilføj ikke (Team Mappe) til offentliggjorte mapper**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2095
msgid ""
"A team folder by default, when showing up in a team user's folder list, "
"it will have “(Team Folder)” appended to the end of the folder name to "
"signify it is a team folder. This feature allows a team folder showing up"
" as it is without the (Team Folder) suffix. The use case is that when a "
"network share is mounted and then turned into a team folder, since the "
"users are already familiar with the network share in its original name, "
"so it is not necessary to append (team folder) to the folder name. You "
"shouldn't change this setting in the middle of operation because if users"
" have pending upload/download, changing the name could cause those tasks "
"to fail."
msgstr "En teammappe som standard, når den vises på en teambrugers mappe liste, vil den have “(Team Mappe)” tilføjet til slutningen af mappenavnet for at betegne, at det er en teammappe. Denne funktion tillader en teammappe at blive vist som den er uden (Team Mappe) suffikset. Anvendelsescasen er, at når et netværksdrev er monteret og derefter omdannet til en teammappe, eftersom brugerne allerede er fortrolige med netværksdrevet under dets oprindelige navn, så er det ikke nødvendigt at tilføje (teammappe) til mappenavnet. Du bør ikke ændre denne indstilling midt i en operation, fordi hvis brugere har ventende upload/download, kan ændring af navnet forårsage, at disse opgaver mislykkes."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2105
msgid "Attached Folder"
msgstr "Vedhæftet mappe"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2107
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Folder & Storage`` > ``Attached "
"Folder``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Mappe & Lager`` > ``Tilknyttet Mappe``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2112
msgid "ATTACHED FOLDER SETTINGS"
msgstr "VEDHÆFTET MAPPEINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2115
msgid "**Disable backup/attach local folder from client device**"
msgstr "**Deaktiver backup/tilknyt lokal mappe fra klientenhed**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2117
msgid ""
"Attached Local Folders are two-way synchronization folders. In order to "
"do version backup and two-way synchronization, there are multiple folder "
"structures created in the backend storage. Some organization doesn't need"
" this feature and want the users to work exclusively with the cloud "
"drive."
msgstr "Vedhæftede lokale mapper er mapper med tovejssynkronisering. For at kunne lave versionsbackup og tovejssynkronisering oprettes der flere mappestrukturer i backend-lagringen. Nogle organisationer har ikke brug for denne funktion og ønsker, at brugerne udelukkende arbejder med cloud-drevet."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2122
msgid "**Enable Snapshot backup for server agent**"
msgstr "**Aktivér Snapshot-backup for serveragent**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2124
msgid "It is a feature related to server agent on Windows 2003-2012 servers."
msgstr "Det er en funktion relateret til serveragent på Windows 2003-2012 servere."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2126
msgid "**Allow syncing empty files**"
msgstr "**Tillad synkronisering af tomme filer**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2128
msgid ""
"By default, empty file (0-byte) will be skipped for syncing in attached "
"folder. when enabled, those files will be synchronized."
msgstr "Som standard vil tomme filer (0 byte) blive sprunget over ved synkronisering i den vedhæftede mappe. Når det er aktiveret, vil disse filer blive synkroniseret."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2131
msgid "**Allow syncing of hidden files**"
msgstr "**Tillad synkronisering af skjulte filer**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2133
msgid "Hidden files by default will not sync."
msgstr "Skjulte filer synkroniseres som standard ikke."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2135
msgid "**Allow executable files (.exe)**"
msgstr "**Tillad eksekverbare filer (.exe)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2137 ../../chapter03.rst:2141
msgid "Executable files by default will not sync."
msgstr "Eksekverbare filer synkroniseres som standard ikke."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2139
msgid "**Allow ISO files (.iso)**"
msgstr "**Tillad ISO-filer (.iso)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2143
msgid "**Allow backup files(.bck, .bkf,.rbf, .tib)**"
msgstr "**Tillad backup-filer (.bck, .bkf, .rbf, .tib)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2145
msgid ""
"**Allow VMs (.hdd, .hds, .pvm, .pvs, .vdi, .vfd, .vhd, .vmc, .vmdk, "
".vmem, .vmsd, .vmsn, .vmss, .vmtm, .vmwarevm, .vmx, .vmxf, .vsv, .nvram, "
".vud, .xva)**"
msgstr "**Tillad VM'er (.hdd, .hds, .pvm, .pvs, .vdi, .vfd, .vhd, .vmc, .vmdk, .vmem, .vmsd, .vmsn, .vmss, .vmtm, .vmwarevm, .vmx, .vmxf, .vsv, .nvram, .vud, .xva)**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2147
msgid "**Allow application folders**"
msgstr "**Tillad applikationsmapper**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2149
msgid "Application folder by default will not sync."
msgstr "Applikationsmappen synkroniseres som standard ikke."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2151
msgid "**Allow application data folders**"
msgstr "**Tillad applikationsdatamapper**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2153
msgid "Application data folder by default will not sync."
msgstr "Applikationsdata-mappen synkroniseres som standard ikke."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2155
msgid "**Enable scheduled sync for files with following extensions**"
msgstr "**Aktivér planlagt synkronisering for filer med følgende filtypenavne**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2157
msgid ""
"This is to help sync/upload frequently changed file such as Microsoft "
"access database or QuickBook files. These type of files typically are "
"constantly open (thus prevent other application to hold on to them) and "
"also changed frequently. So you can define the time period to check back "
"on these type of files and use volume shadow copy to upload these files."
msgstr "Dette er for at hjælpe med at synkronisere/oploade ofte ændrede filer såsom Microsoft Access-databaser eller QuickBook-filer. Disse typer filer er typisk konstant åbne (og forhindrer dermed andre applikationer i at holde fast i dem) og ændres også ofte. Så du kan definere tidsperioden for at tjekke tilbage på disse typer filer og bruge skyggekopiering til at uploade disse filer."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2166
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filtre"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2168
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Folder & Storage`` > ``Filters``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Mappe & Lager`` > ``Filtre``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2173
msgid "FILTER SETTINGS"
msgstr "FILTERINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2175
msgid ""
"**Files with the following extensions will be excluded from attached "
"local folder**"
msgstr "**Filer med følgende udvidelser vil blive udelukket fra den vedhæftede lokale mappe**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2177
msgid ""
"You can stop certain file types from being uploaded. For example .pst "
"files. These are local outlook email files, which is not necessary to "
"upload into the cloud storage because usually it is backed up by an "
"exchange server."
msgstr "Du kan forhindre upload af bestemte filtyper. For eksempel .pst filer. Disse er lokale Outlook e-mailfiler, hvilket ikke er nødvendigt at uploade til cloudlagring, fordi de som regel er sikkerhedskopieret af en Exchange-server."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2182
msgid ""
"**Files with following extensions will be excluded from directory listing"
" (i.e.[.qbw])**"
msgstr "**Filer med følgende filtypenavne vil blive udelukket fra mappefortegnelsen (dvs. [.qbw])**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2184
msgid ""
"You can specify the executables which should not be listed under a user's"
" directory."
msgstr "Du kan angive de eksekverbare filer, som ikke bør vises i en brugers mappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2187
msgid ""
"**In-place editing/Preview is disabled for files with following "
"extension**"
msgstr "**Redigering/forhåndsvisning på stedet er deaktiveret for filer med følgende filtype**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2189
msgid ""
"Windows Explorer has a habit to peek into large files to generate "
"thumbnail and present other information. It may not be a good fit for "
"cloud drive files because each peek will generate a download from cloud."
msgstr "Windows Stifinder har en vane med at kigge ind i store filer for at generere miniaturebilleder og præsentere andre oplysninger. Det er måske ikke velegnet til cloud-drev filer, fordi hver kig vil generere en download fra skyen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2193
msgid "**Allow file without file name extension**"
msgstr "**Tillad fil uden filnavnsudvidelse**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2195
msgid "Allow files without extension suffix to synchronize."
msgstr "Tillad synkronisering af filer uden filtypeendelse."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2198
msgid "**Allow syncing empty file**"
msgstr "**Tillad synkronisering af tom fil**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2200
msgid "This is the same setting as in the \"Attached Folder\" section."
msgstr "Dette er den samme indstilling som i sektionen \"Vedhæftet mappe\"."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2204
msgid "Background Tasks"
msgstr "Baggrundsopgaver"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2206
msgid ""
"``Tenant Manager`` > ``Settings`` > ``Folder & Storage`` > ``Background "
"Tasks``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Indstillinger`` > ``Mappe & Lager`` > ``Baggrundsopgaver``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2208
msgid ""
"There are three different kind of background tasks that may take a long "
"time to finish:"
msgstr "Der er tre forskellige slags baggrundsopgaver, som kan tage lang tid at afslutte:"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2210
msgid "Data Seeding - copying data into |prodname|"
msgstr "Data Seeding - kopiering af data ind i |prodname|"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2211
msgid "Storage Scan - do a full scan to calculate storage consumption"
msgstr "Lager Skanning - udfør en fuld skanning for at beregne lagerforbruget"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2212
msgid ""
"Tenant Storage Migration - move tenant storage from location A to "
"location B"
msgstr "Lejerlagringsmigration - flyt lejerlager fra placering A til placering B"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2213
msgid "Anchor Migration -  move data out of Anchor and into |prodname|"
msgstr "Anchor Migration - flyt data ud af Anchor og ind i |prodname|"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2219
msgid "BACKGROUND TASKS"
msgstr "BAGGRUNDSOPGAVER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2221
msgid ""
"The cluster administrator can help the tenant seed the data. For example "
"take data into a USB drive and take it to the same local area network as "
"the Cluster Server and see the data into the tenant storage."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan hjælpe lejeren med at forberede dataene. For eksempel kan man tage dataene over på et USB-drev og bringe det til det samme lokale netværk som klynge-serveren og se dataene ind i lejerens lager."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2224
msgid "**Add New Data Seeding Task**"
msgstr "**Tilføj ny opgave til dataseeding**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2226
msgid "``Background Tasks`` > ``+`` > ``Add New Data Seeding Task``"
msgstr "``Baggrundsopgaver`` > ``+`` > ``Tilføj ny data seeding-opgave``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2231
msgid "DATA SEEDING"
msgstr "DATA SEEDING"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2233
msgid ""
"Data Seeding is to take a folder from a source location and seed it into "
"a team folder."
msgstr "Data Seeding er at tage en mappe fra en kildeplacering og så den i en teammappe."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2235
msgid "On the left of the dialog, it is the source folder path information."
msgstr "Til venstre i dialogboksen er det oplysninger om sti til kilde mappen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2237
msgid "On the right side of the dialog, it is the target team folder information."
msgstr "På højre side af dialogboksen er det målrettede teammappes information."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2239
msgid ""
"If you are seeding the data into a brand new team folder, you will first "
"go into the team folder area and create a new team folder with empty "
"content inside, and then come back to data seeding page and select it "
"from the team folder drop down."
msgstr "Hvis du indsætter data i en helt ny teammappe, skal du først gå ind i teammappesektionen og oprette en ny teammappe med tomt indhold indeni, og derefter vende tilbage til datasåningssiden og vælge den fra rullemenuen for teammapper."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2244
msgid "Tenant Branding"
msgstr "Lejermærkning"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2246
msgid "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Branding`` > ``Tenant Branding``"
msgstr "``Tenant Manager`` > ``Branding`` > ``Lejer Branding``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2248
msgid ""
"The cluster administrator can help the tenant do the tenant-specific "
"branding in the partner portal."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan hjælpe lejeren med at lave lejerspecifik branding i partnerportalen."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2250
msgid ""
"The branding is applied by the customized URL. You can think of the "
"customized URL as a primary key to retrieve all tenant related branding "
"information."
msgstr "Branding påføres via den tilpassede URL. Du kan tænke på den tilpassede URL som en primær nøgle til at hente alle lejerrelaterede brandingoplysninger."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2255
msgid ""
"If per-tenant branding is enabled, The tenant branding section will be "
"available."
msgstr "Hvis branding pr. lejer er aktiveret, vil afsnittet om lejerbranding være tilgængeligt."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2260
msgid "PER-TENANT BRANDING OPTIONS"
msgstr "PER-TENANT BRANDING MULIGHEDER"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2262
msgid "**Customized URL for your business**"
msgstr "**Tilpasset URL til din virksomhed**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2264
msgid ""
"Typically the customize URL is a sub domain of the Cluster Server. For "
"example, if the Cluster Server is at https://cloud.mycompany.com, the sub"
" domain can be https://acme1.mycompany.com"
msgstr "Typisk er den tilpassede URL en underdomæne af klyngeserveren. For eksempel, hvis klyngeserveren er på https://cloud.mycompany.com, kan underdomænet være https://acme1.mycompany.com"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2266
msgid ""
"In Windows 2012 and above (the server that has the Cluster Server "
"running), it also allows SNI (Server name indicator) in the SSL "
"certificate binding. So it is possible to bind multiple SSL certificates "
"to the same IIS server. In this case, the Customized URL can be a fully "
"qualified domain name."
msgstr "I Windows 2012 og nyere (serveren, der har Cluster Server kørende), tillader det også SNI (Servernavnsindikator) i SSL-certifikatbindingen. Så det er muligt at binde flere SSL-certifikater til den samme IIS-server. I dette tilfælde kan den tilpassede URL være et fuldt kvalificeret domænenavn."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2270
msgid ""
"If you set up per-tenant branding, make sure the customized URL is "
"specific to each tenant and also the URL is different from the default "
"URL."
msgstr "Hvis du opsætter branding pr. lejer, skal du sørge for, at den tilpassede URL er specifik for hver lejer, og at URL'en også er forskellig fra standard-URL'en."

#: ../../chapter03.rst:2272
msgid ""
"If you don't want to setup per-tenant branding, disable it in cluster "
"settings and setup cluster-wide branding instead."
msgstr "Hvis du ikke ønsker at opsætte branding pr. lejer, skal du deaktivere det i klyngeindstillingerne og i stedet opsætte branding for hele klyngen."

